Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:30.87,英文,,0,0,0,,400 years ago, Mo Kuei (Demon Lord) threatened the entire Wulin (Martial World).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:30.87,中文,,0,0,0,,四百年前 魔魁为祸武林
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:37.12,英文,,0,0,0,,The great sage Su Huan-jen, in his attempt to eliminate evil, summoned the warriors from the Three Clans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:37.12,中文,,0,0,0,,一代神人素还真为弥平祸劫 召集三(教)传人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:43.24,英文,,0,0,0,,They tried to defeat Mo Kuei while he was on the top of Sky Ridge and absorbing the spiritual Qi (Aura).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:43.24,中文,,0,0,0,,利用魔魁在天脊峰吸收大地灵气之际 联手伏魔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:21.87,英文,,0,0,0,,The wind and cloud rumbled with death in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:21.87,中文,,0,0,0,,风云卷荡 杀气迷蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:25.83,英文,,0,0,0,,The good and the evil fought on Sky Ridge. The destiny of the whole Wulin hangs in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:25.83,中文,,0,0,0,,天脊峰正邪之战 关系整个武林存亡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:28.46,英文,,0,0,0,,Rancor 12, successor of the Confucianists School,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:28.46,中文,,0,0,0,,儒教传人剑君十二恨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.33,英文,,0,0,0,,together with the Daoist school's Luan-Shr Kuang-Dau (Crazed Blade)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.33,中文,,0,0,0,,道教传人乱世狂刀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.75,英文,,0,0,0,,and Ye Shiau-Chai of the School of Buddists fought Mo Kuei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.75,中文,,0,0,0,,佛教传人叶小钗 力战魔魁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:36.08,英文,,0,0,0,,While Shaolin, Wudang, Omei, Huashan, Kunlun, and Diancan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:36.08,中文,,0,0,0,,同时还有少林 武当 峨眉 华山 昆仑 点苍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:38.12,英文,,0,0,0,,the six major Wulin sects
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:38.12,中文,,0,0,0,,武林六大门派镇守外围
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:41.75,英文,,0,0,0,,surrounded the battlefield. The furious beast was trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:41.75,中文,,0,0,0,,重重包围 魔魁有如一头被困的猛兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Mo Kuei was struck hard and dug deep into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.37,中文,,0,0,0,,魔魁中了绝招 潜入地层
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.00,英文,,0,0,0,,This led to energy being jetted out from under the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.00,中文,,0,0,0,,引动地层之下能量四射
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, the ground cracked open
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.96,中文,,0,0,0,,忽然间 地洞灵气流窜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.00,英文,,0,0,0,,and Mo Kuei was broken free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.00,中文,,0,0,0,,魔魁破土而出了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.17,英文,,0,0,0,,The spiritual Qi of Heaven and Earth is now fused.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.17,中文,,0,0,0,,大地灵气交合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Once Mo Kuei absorbs it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.00,中文,,0,0,0,,旦让魔魁吸取
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:14.08,英文,,0,0,0,,he'll be invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:14.08,中文,,0,0,0,,魔魁将是天下无敌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Hell Reincarnation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.33,中文,,0,0,0,,冥式轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:32.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Knowing this is their best chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:32.00,中文,,0,0,0,,三传人见伏魔时机不可失
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:34.67,英文,,0,0,0,,the three warriors gave all they've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:34.67,中文,,0,0,0,,即刻运动元功 绝招尽出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:37.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Gentleman's Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:37.37,中文,,0,0,0,,君子风
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:45.46,英文,,0,0,0,,Heaven and Earth's Roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:45.46,中文,,0,0,0,,天地根
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:33.87,英文,,0,0,0,,It's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:33.87,中文,,0,0,0,,该死啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.21,英文,,0,0,0,,It was Su Huan-Jen's request
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.21,中文,,0,0,0,,是素还真的交待
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.83,英文,,0,0,0,,that Mo Kuei be under the Six Sects' watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.83,中文,,0,0,0,,将魔魁交给六大门派处置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.75,英文,,0,0,0,,My friends, Mo Kuei is all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.75,中文,,0,0,0,,各位 魔魁就交给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:27.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:27.08,中文,,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:30.29,英文,,0,0,0,,The Six Dao Realms are a treacherous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:30.29,中文,,0,0,0,,六道轮回乃是天然险地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:34.67,英文,,0,0,0,,With the traps that Su Huan-Jen has installed personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:34.67,中文,,0,0,0,,加上素还真亲自排设了机关阵图
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:37.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Mo Kuei has no way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:37.08,中文,,0,0,0,,魔魁逃生无门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:39.71,英文,,0,0,0,,He will be imprisoned here for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:39.71,中文,,0,0,0,,他将要一辈子被禁於此地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:44.75,英文,,0,0,0,,This demon had committed too many evil deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:44.75,中文,,0,0,0,,哼此魔恶贯满盈 天理难容
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:49.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Even life imprisonment is a luxury for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:49.21,中文,,0,0,0,,判他终身监禁 算是便宜他了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:50.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mo Kuei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:50.50,中文,,0,0,0,,走吧 魔魁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:57.46,英文,,0,0,0,,What demon is here?! Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:57.46,中文,,0,0,0,,何方妖怪 快现身来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:17.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Reverend Wei Shing (Wisdom).
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:17.08,中文,,0,0,0,,慧性大师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:46.00,英文,,0,0,0,,The Unkinds. The demons that haunt me in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:46.00,中文,,0,0,0,,非善类为何是我挥之不去的噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:28.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Prepare for examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:28.00,中文,,0,0,0,,准备测试
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:30.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Prepare the skeleton visualizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:30.54,中文,,0,0,0,,放下颅驍显像仪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:35.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:35.04,中文,,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:38.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:38.83,中文,,0,0,0,,酷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:40.21,英文,,0,0,0,,We've got TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:40.21,中文,,0,0,0,,有电视看了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:43.42,英文,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:43.42,中文,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.04,英文,,0,0,0,,So violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.04,中文,,0,0,0,,暴力画面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:53.12,英文,,0,0,0,,So scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:53.12,中文,,0,0,0,,好可怕呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:58.00,英文,,0,0,0,,We've got to find the Fairy Bird's leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:58.00,中文,,0,0,0,,一定要找出仙鸟之腿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:10:59.04,英文,,0,0,0,,The leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:10:59.04,中文,,0,0,0,,腿…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:10.62,英文,,0,0,0,,The leg's there! Your Majesty, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:10.62,中文,,0,0,0,,腿出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:14.71,英文,,0,0,0,,There's the leg! Quick, zoom in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:14.71,中文,,0,0,0,,就是它 快放大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:15.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:15.83,中文,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:21.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Remember the spot. Set out immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:21.83,中文,,0,0,0,,记住地方 立刻行动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:30.08,英文,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful night!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:30.08,中文,,0,0,0,,好美的夜色
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:33.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Fly, fly... I'm as light as a sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:33.21,中文,,0,0,0,,我飞 我飞 我身轻如燕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:37.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:37.21,中文,,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:39.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:39.75,中文,,0,0,0,,开始行动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Really? Asking a gentleman to trespass? That's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.50,中文,,0,0,0,,真是的 叫绅士闯空门 像话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.08,英文,,0,0,0,,What a luxurious residence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.08,中文,,0,0,0,,好高级的住宅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:01.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Too much force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:01.67,中文,,0,0,0,,对不起 太用力了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:03.67,英文,,0,0,0,,That's alright. The owner is deaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:03.67,中文,,0,0,0,,不要紧啦主人是聋子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:04.67,英文,,0,0,0,,What's that on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:04.67,中文,,0,0,0,,桌上那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.25,英文,,0,0,0,,It's round like a pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.25,中文,,0,0,0,,圆圆的像披萨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:11.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Look! Two more pizzas! Even bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:11.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你看 有两个更大的披萨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:13.92,英文,,0,0,0,,They've got to be related somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:13.92,中文,,0,0,0,,这一定有关联
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.12,英文,,0,0,0,,Let's try to throw it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.12,中文,,0,0,0,,把它抛过去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.54,英文,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.54,中文,,0,0,0,,好神奇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:18.13,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother, I don't understand. Why didn't you kill Mo Kuei?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:18.13,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥 我不能明白 为何你不杀魔魁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:22.96,英文,,0,0,0,,There's something you don't know, brother. Even if the body dies, the spirit will linger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:22.96,中文,,0,0,0,,贤弟有所不知 杀得了肉体 杀不了元灵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:27.54,英文,,0,0,0,,If we killed him, then we'd be repeating what happened 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:27.54,中文,,0,0,0,,此时杀了他 只有重蹈四百年前的覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.13,0:13:32.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Mo Kuei will always reincarnate. And the calamity will never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.13,0:13:32.21,中文,,0,0,0,,魔魁终究会再重生 災劫也永不休止
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.08,英文,,0,0,0,,But we can't just imprison him forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.08,中文,,0,0,0,,但总不能将他永远地囚禁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.46,英文,,0,0,0,,That is only temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.46,中文,,0,0,0,,这只是暂时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:41.62,英文,,0,0,0,,There's one thing we need to find that can obliterate Mo Kuei completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:41.62,中文,,0,0,0,,如能寻获一物 便可以完全消灭魔魁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:43.04,英文,,0,0,0,,What thing is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:43.04,中文,,0,0,0,,是何物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.83,0:13:45.04,英文,,0,0,0,,The Bodhi Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.83,0:13:45.04,中文,,0,0,0,,菩提明镜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:48.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Bodhi Mirror is the deterrent to all spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:48.04,中文,,0,0,0,,菩提明镜乃是元灵之克星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:53.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Any spiritual aura will not be able to survive the light that shines from the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:53.00,中文,,0,0,0,,任何灵气在镜光的照射之下 尽化虛无
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:56.96,英文,,0,0,0,,That is why you recruited the three clan warriors to search for this entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:56.96,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥派出三传人 就是为找寻此物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:58.63,英文,,0,0,0,,Indeed. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:58.63,中文,,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.11,0:14:03.72,英文,,0,0,0,,Once this relic is found, then Mo Kuei will never be able to reincarnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.11,0:14:03.72,中文,,0,0,0,,只要能找到此物 魔魁就永无再生之期了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.79,0:14:07.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Was someone here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.79,0:14:07.08,中文,,0,0,0,,方才有人来过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:08.71,英文,,0,0,0,,Not to our knowledge, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:08.71,中文,,0,0,0,,师尊 没呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.21,英文,,0,0,0,,To be able to hang this knot silently
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.21,中文,,0,0,0,,能瞒过你们的耳目
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:12.62,英文,,0,0,0,,without attracting our attention...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:12.62,中文,,0,0,0,,无声无息挂上此结
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.92,英文,,0,0,0,,This person must be quite skillful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.92,中文,,0,0,0,,此人功力不差
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:18.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother. What does this knot mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:18.08,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥 这个结有什么用意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:19.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:19.58,中文,,0,0,0,,这嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.67,英文,,0,0,0,,It's an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这是一个邀请函
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:29.62,英文,,0,0,0,,The knot represents knighthood, message, and secret. The parts that make up these three words
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:29.62,中文,,0,0,0,,“结”者乃“士”“口”“系”三字的组合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:31.62,英文,,0,0,0,,share the same pronunciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:31.62,中文,,0,0,0,,“糸”与“密” 同音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:33.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Sir, message, secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:33.83,中文,,0,0,0,,有一士以口说密
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Someone wants to meet with me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.17,中文,,0,0,0,,也就是有人想约吾一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.50,英文,,0,0,0,,and to tell me about a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.50,中文,,0,0,0,,欲向吾说一件秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:40.62,英文,,0,0,0,,So that's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:40.62,中文,,0,0,0,,原来是这个含意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.04,英文,,0,0,0,,But without the time and the place, how will you know where to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.04,中文,,0,0,0,,可是也没时间地点 如何赴约
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:47.68,英文,,0,0,0,,This is a plum blossom knot. It's surrounded by 10 algae knots on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:47.68,中文,,0,0,0,,这是一个梅花结 外环有十个藻井结
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:48.92,英文,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:48.92,中文,,0,0,0,,那又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:52.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Plum blossom is also known as cold fragrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:52.17,中文,,0,0,0,,梅花一称冷香
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:56.92,英文,,0,0,0,,There's a saying, "The fragrance chills to the bones. And the beauty is sumptuous like meals."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:56.92,中文,,0,0,0,,所谓冷香凝到骨 琼艳几堪餐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:14:59.75,英文,,0,0,0,,It's an ode to the plum blossom's beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:14:59.75,中文,,0,0,0,,便是赞颂梅花之姿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:05.33,英文,,0,0,0,,While algae grows in water in circles. That implies a water surrounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:05.33,中文,,0,0,0,,而藻乃水生植物 结而成环 有环水之意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:07.75,英文,,0,0,0,,It has to be a lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:07.75,中文,,0,0,0,,也就是指湖泊之属
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:11.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Once you combine the two, it's not hard to decipher the meeting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:11.75,中文,,0,0,0,,两者相加 便不难明白赴约的地点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:14.04,英文,,0,0,0,,It has to be Cold Fragrance River.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:14.04,中文,,0,0,0,,必是指冷香湖了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.25,英文,,0,0,0,,This is the Cold Fragrance River.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.25,中文,,0,0,0,,此地就是冷香湖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:52.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother, you are indeed ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:52.17,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥你果然神机妙算
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:53.62,英文,,0,0,0,,You are too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:53.62,中文,,0,0,0,,过奖了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:56.17,英文,,0,0,0,,We have only passed the first test though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:56.17,中文,,0,0,0,,我们只通过第一关的文试
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:57.92,英文,,0,0,0,,There is a second one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:57.92,中文,,0,0,0,,还有第二关呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:01.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Crossing the river in a paper boat? That's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:01.08,中文,,0,0,0,,纸船渡岸 难不倒青阳子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:03.54,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:03.54,中文,,0,0,0,,恐怕不是这么容易
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:19.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Well. There are some obstacles, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.92,0:16:19.67,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么 遇到难关了 是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.67,英文,,0,0,0,,How can we avoid the fire in a paper boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.67,中文,,0,0,0,,纸船渡岸如何避过火势呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:27.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Fine. I will use the "Thousand Miles Magic Bomb" to wipe out the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:27.08,中文,,0,0,0,,好 待我施展千里神弹 将火势拨开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:28.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:28.50,中文,,0,0,0,,稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:32.62,英文,,0,0,0,,There is not a good way. We don't want to offend the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:32.62,中文,,0,0,0,,此法恐有不妥 对主人太失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:33.96,英文,,0,0,0,,What would you suggest, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:33.96,中文,,0,0,0,,那依大哥之见
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:37.29,英文,,0,0,0,,The Violet Qi from the East.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:37.29,中文,,0,0,0,,紫气东来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:17.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:17.08,中文,,0,0,0,,好功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:24.87,英文,,0,0,0,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:24.87,中文,,0,0,0,,素某依约而来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:29.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:29.08,中文,,0,0,0,,两位贵客 请进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:40.25,英文,,0,0,0,,It's Senior!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:40.25,中文,,0,0,0,,是前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:43.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior Au-Shiau Hung-Chen! It's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:43.96,中文,,0,0,0,,是傲笑红尘前辈 青阳有礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:49.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Ever since you retired from Wulin, Senior, I have always missed you deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:49.17,中文,,0,0,0,,自从前辈息交绝游 在下一直十分怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:52.42,英文,,0,0,0,,I never thought that I would see you again here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:52.42,中文,,0,0,0,,想不到能在此地再次见到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:55.21,英文,,0,0,0,,I've come here, only to do a favor for my late friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:55.21,中文,,0,0,0,,我来此只是为故友尽一点心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:58.67,英文,,0,0,0,,This lady here is his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:58.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这位姑娘是我的故友之女
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:03.08,英文,,0,0,0,,She must be a great warrior too to befriend a hero like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:03.08,中文,,0,0,0,,能让前辈结交 必是英雄豪傑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:07.17,英文,,0,0,0,,My dear, this is Su Huan-Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:07.17,中文,,0,0,0,,世侄女 这位就是素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:09.54,英文,,0,0,0,,And this is Ching Yang-Zi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:09.54,中文,,0,0,0,,而另外这位是青阳子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:11.96,英文,,0,0,0,,He is a righteous and honorable warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:11.96,中文,,0,0,0,,是一名光明磊落的好汉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:15.00,英文,,0,0,0,,I am honored to meet both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:15.00,中文,,0,0,0,,见过两位前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:18.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Now that I have introduced you, I must be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:18.21,中文,,0,0,0,,为你引见过 我也要离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:19.46,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:19.46,中文,,0,0,0,,前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:23.67,英文,,0,0,0,,So soon? Why leave in such a haste?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:23.67,中文,,0,0,0,,匆匆一会 前辈就要离开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:27.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Do you and I still have misunderstandings that are unresolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:27.21,中文,,0,0,0,,难道以往对素某的误会尚未解开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:29.75,英文,,0,0,0,,I have no misunderstandings with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:29.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我没误会任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:31.00,英文,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:31.00,中文,,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:35.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother, you should escort Senior out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:35.75,中文,,0,0,0,,贤弟 你赶快送前辈一程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:36.46,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:36.46,中文,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:47.54,英文,,0,0,0,,I have long heard that Su, the "Fragrant White Lotus," is a cultivated and courteous gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:47.54,中文,,0,0,0,,久闻清香白莲素还真 乃是一名彬彬有礼的君子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:51.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Now that we have met, it is indeed true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:51.67,中文,,0,0,0,,今日一见 果然名不虚传
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:54.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I haven't asked your name yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:54.67,中文,,0,0,0,,尚未请教尊名
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:57.12,英文,,0,0,0,,My name is Jian Ru-Bing (Sword Like Ice).
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:57.12,中文,,0,0,0,,小女子剑如冰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.29,0:19:01.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Lady Jian, by using a knot as invitation, I reckon you have something secret to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.29,0:19:01.33,中文,,0,0,0,,剑姑娘以结相邀 表示有秘密与劣者参详
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:05.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Are you aware that Mo Kuei has escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:05.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你可知魔魁已经脱逃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:09.33,英文,,0,0,0,,And representatives from the Six Sects have all perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:09.33,中文,,0,0,0,,六大门派的代表 也全数身亡了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:13.04,英文,,0,0,0,,How... How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:13.04,中文,,0,0,0,,这 这怎有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:20.79,英文,,0,0,0,,Did you really feel completely confident that your Six Dao Reincarnation Formation could have trapped Mo Kuei?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:20.79,中文,,0,0,0,,你敢完全自信你苦心排成的六道轮回阵 禁得了魔魁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:23.25,英文,,0,0,0,,So Mo Kuei's power is beyond comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:23.25,中文,,0,0,0,,原来魔魁如此深不可测
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:25.12,英文,,0,0,0,,I miscalculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:25.12,中文,,0,0,0,,素某失算了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:29.58,英文,,0,0,0,,No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:29.58,中文,,0,0,0,,你並没失算
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:33.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Your formation worked and Mo Kuei was indeed trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:33.75,中文,,0,0,0,,六道轮回阵确实锁住魔魁了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:37.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Could there be greater powers who intervened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:37.00,中文,,0,0,0,,难道另有高人救走魔魁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:40.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Correct. It was the Unkinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:40.96,中文,,0,0,0,,不错 就是非善类
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:58.29,英文,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that. And six righteous warriors died in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:58.29,中文,,0,0,0,,素某失算 葬送六名正道的栋梁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:02.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother. What exactly is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:02.37,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥 这到底是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:04.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Lady Jian was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:04.83,中文,,0,0,0,,剑姑娘讲得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:08.08,英文,,0,0,0,,The Unkinds took Mo Kuei away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:08.08,中文,,0,0,0,,魔魁已经被非善类劫走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:09.37,英文,,0,0,0,,The Unkinds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:09.37,中文,,0,0,0,,非善类
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:12.75,英文,,0,0,0,,They are monsters of unknown origin,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:12.75,中文,,0,0,0,,一种不知来自何方的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:16.37,英文,,0,0,0,,capable of taking human form and coming and going without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:16.37,中文,,0,0,0,,能化成人形 神出鬼没
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:20.83,英文,,0,0,0,,They're after the Tianwen (Heaven-Questioning) Stone. That's why they rescued Mo Kuei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:20.83,中文,,0,0,0,,他们救走魔魁 是为了夺取天问石
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:25.29,英文,,0,0,0,,With Mo Kuei on the run, if he defeats all three clan successors, then
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:25.29,中文,,0,0,0,,魔魁脱逃 万一将三传人个个击破
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.75,英文,,0,0,0,,no one will ever be able to restrain the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:28.75,中文,,0,0,0,,将永远无人可以制衡魔魁了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:33.87,英文,,0,0,0,,But they're scattered all over Wulin searching for the Budhi mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:33.87,中文,,0,0,0,,但是 三传人各自在武林中找寻菩提明镜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:36.29,英文,,0,0,0,,How are we going to alert them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:36.29,中文,,0,0,0,,如何通知他们小心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.79,英文,,0,0,0,,The search for the Budhi mirror must cease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.79,中文,,0,0,0,,找寻菩提明镜的任务中止
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:44.54,英文,,0,0,0,,We should focus our efforts on the Unkinds and the Tianwen Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:44.54,中文,,0,0,0,,将精神集中在非善类与天问石之上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:48.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Are you capable of defeating the Unkinds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:48.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你们有能力对付非善类吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:49.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:49.00,中文,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.00,英文,,0,0,0,,If you're not, then don't show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.00,中文,,0,0,0,,沒能力就不要逞強
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:06.75,英文,,0,0,0,,What an idle fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:06.75,中文,,0,0,0,,无聊之徒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.21,0:21:08.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Hell Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.21,0:21:08.87,中文,,0,0,0,,地狱谷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:11.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Ching Yang, we should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:11.25,中文,,0,0,0,,青阳 咱们快走
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:14.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Do we look like gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:14.62,中文,,0,0,0,,我们这样像绅士吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:15.62,英文,,0,0,0,,We look handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:15.62,中文,,0,0,0,,帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.25,英文,,0,0,0,,We're the most handsome men in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.25,中文,,0,0,0,,我们是世界上最帅的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:25.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Here's the bridge. Cross the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:25.62,中文,,0,0,0,,到了就是这里 过桥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:28.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Don't shake! You're making me dizzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:28.00,中文,,0,0,0,,不要摇 我的头好昏哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:30.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Slow down! I need to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:30.58,中文,,0,0,0,,跑慢一点我想尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:32.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Wear a diaper next time! Such a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:32.67,中文,,0,0,0,,下次要穿纸內裤 免得啰里啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:34.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:34.04,中文,,0,0,0,,我的妈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:37.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Time to lose some weight, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:37.87,中文,,0,0,0,,该减肥了兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:38.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:38.67,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:41.67,英文,,0,0,0,,What kind of a bridge is this? They must have cut some corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:41.67,中文,,0,0,0,,-这是什么桥啊 -当然是偷工减料桥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.67,0:21:43.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Who's the builder? Stop complaining. At least you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.67,0:21:43.96,中文,,0,0,0,,- 承包商是谁 -别抱怨 至少你还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:50.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Someone was here before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:50.04,中文,,0,0,0,,有人抢先一步
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:51.92,英文,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:51.92,中文,,0,0,0,,现在要如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:53.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Just cross the bridge first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:53.92,中文,,0,0,0,,先过桥再说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.83,0:22:14.75,英文,,0,0,0,,It's so dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.83,0:22:14.75,中文,,0,0,0,,好暗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:16.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Be careful, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:16.75,中文,,0,0,0,,大家要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:27.08,英文,,0,0,0,,The door is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:27.08,中文,,0,0,0,,门开了门开了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:39.83,英文,,0,0,0,,There! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:39.83,中文,,0,0,0,,这样才是正确的 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:44.83,英文,,0,0,0,,This is too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:44.83,中文,,0,0,0,,这次的任务太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.13,0:22:52.75,英文,,0,0,0,,What should we do without the Fairy Bird's leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.13,0:22:52.75,中文,,0,0,0,,没有仙鸟之腿怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:54.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Try your claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:54.17,中文,,0,0,0,,用鸡爪试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:06.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:06.96,中文,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:08.29,英文,,0,0,0,,The door is really open.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:08.29,中文,,0,0,0,,门又开了
Comment: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.71,英文,,0,0,0,,这个在英语sup里本来是没有的，就随便翻了个“抢”。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:14.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Tianwen Stone！Grab it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.75,0:23:14.54,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石 抢
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,英文,,0,0,0,,这个在英语sup里本来是没有的，就随便翻了个“抢”。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.71,英文,,0,0,0,,Explosive chicken! So scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.71,中文,,0,0,0,,爆炸鸡丁好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.67,英文,,0,0,0,,We should come back later after we've found the Fairy Bird's leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.67,中文,,0,0,0,,等找到另外一支仙鸟之腿再来吧
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,英文,,0,0,0,,这个也是没有的，随便翻的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.17,0:23:36.17,英文,,0,0,0,,My! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.17,0:23:36.17,中文,,0,0,0,,妈啊有鬼
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,英文,,0,0,0,,这个也是没有的，随便翻的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.17,0:23:39.58,英文,,0,0,0,,So the Unkinds do exist in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.17,0:23:39.58,中文,,0,0,0,,原来世上真有非善类这种異类
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:42.12,英文,,0,0,0,,You do not originate from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:42.12,中文,,0,0,0,,各位并非苦境生物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:45.54,英文,,0,0,0,,You should not be intruding in humankind's living space.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:45.54,中文,,0,0,0,,就不该侵入人类的生存空间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.83,0:23:51.00,英文,,0,0,0,,The universe is so vast. It's not exclusive to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.83,0:23:51.00,中文,,0,0,0,,宇宙何其广大 不是人类独有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.33,0:23:53.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Every life form has the right to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.33,0:23:53.75,中文,,0,0,0,,万物皆有生存权
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.75,0:23:58.00,英文,,0,0,0,,It is not my intention to belittle other life forms or to exalt human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.75,0:23:58.00,中文,,0,0,0,,素某无意藐视万物 独尊人类
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.75,0:24:02.96,英文,,0,0,0,,But, like you said, you should not inflict harm on our right to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.75,0:24:02.96,中文,,0,0,0,,但如你所说 你们也不该危害人类的生存权
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:06.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Please, hand over the magnetic compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:06.92,中文,,0,0,0,,请将磁镭导引献出
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.88,0:24:10.62,英文,,0,0,0,,In your dreams. Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.88,0:24:10.62,中文,,0,0,0,,痴心妄想 杀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.25,0:24:20.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.25,0:24:20.25,中文,,0,0,0,,往哪逃
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.38,0:26:45.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Be careful, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.38,0:26:45.96,中文,,0,0,0,,贤弟小心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.50,0:28:40.42,英文,,0,0,0,,Hand it over now! I can help you get back on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.50,0:28:40.42,中文,,0,0,0,,快将东西交出 我可以助你上岸
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.29,0:28:48.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother, are your pants holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.29,0:28:48.67,中文,,0,0,0,,老兄 你的裤子牢不牢靠
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.00,0:28:50.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Ching Yang, save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.00,0:28:50.25,中文,,0,0,0,,青阳 救他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.08,0:29:05.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Go get the compass, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.08,0:29:05.75,中文,,0,0,0,,快追回磁镭导引
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.00,0:29:08.04,英文,,0,0,0,,But, brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.00,0:29:08.04,中文,,0,0,0,,可是大哥你...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.29,0:29:11.50,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.29,0:29:11.50,中文,,0,0,0,,我还撑得住 快去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.79,0:29:12.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.79,0:29:12.33,中文,,0,0,0,,是
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,英文,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.42,0:29:17.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Come on, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.42,0:29:17.58,中文,,0,0,0,,来啊 呆瓜
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,英文,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.46,0:29:31.25,英文,,0,0,0,,I should think of a way to save brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.46,0:29:31.25,中文,,0,0,0,,先设法救大哥要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:40.08,英文,,0,0,0,,I thought I saw a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:40.08,中文,,0,0,0,,我看见鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.71,0:29:44.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Give me the compass!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.71,0:29:44.29,中文,,0,0,0,,磁镭导引交出
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:46.42,英文,,0,0,0,,Go to hell, you ugly fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.83,0:29:46.42,中文,,0,0,0,,去死吧 丑八怪
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,英文,,0,0,0,,非常短，都不知道怎么翻译好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:06.87,英文,,0,0,0,,It turned out to be my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:06.87,中文,,0,0,0,,原来是要我的命
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,英文,,0,0,0,,非常短，都不知道怎么翻译好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.13,0:30:13.79,英文,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.13,0:30:13.79,中文,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.75,0:30:48.25,英文,,0,0,0,,How can I get the Tianwen Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.75,0:30:48.25,中文,,0,0,0,,我要如何才能取得天问石呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.92,0:30:58.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Back then, our villa was one of the biggest in Wulin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.92,0:30:58.87,中文,,0,0,0,,想当初 我们鸣剑山庄是武林名门
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.92,0:31:03.87,英文,,0,0,0,,There were always guests just like at the scholar Mengchang's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.92,0:31:03.87,中文,,0,0,0,,家中食客三千 不逊孟尝
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.13,0:31:09.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Everyone addressed me with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.13,0:31:09.37,中文,,0,0,0,,人人尊称为父为布衣上卿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.50,0:31:17.87,英文,,0,0,0,,One day, I discovered one of the guests acting rather strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.50,0:31:17.87,中文,,0,0,0,,有一日 为父发现家中一名清客行为怪异
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:20.87,英文,,0,0,0,,After days of observation,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:20.87,中文,,0,0,0,,经过多日的观察
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.54,0:31:24.87,英文,,0,0,0,,I discovered that he was actually a monster in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.54,0:31:24.87,中文,,0,0,0,,发现他竟是一种非人之怪物所化
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:31.21,英文,,0,0,0,,That monster... was what I referred to as the Unkinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:31.21,中文,,0,0,0,,这种怪物 也就是后来为父所称的非善类
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.67,0:31:37.62,英文,,0,0,0,,My whole life... as well as your mother's and your brother's...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.67,0:31:37.62,中文,,0,0,0,,为父的一生 以及你的母亲兄长的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.67,0:31:41.46,英文,,0,0,0,,were completely destroyed by that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.67,0:31:41.46,中文,,0,0,0,,完全毀在这只怪物的手上
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.38,0:31:52.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Now that we have the compass,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.38,0:31:52.54,中文,,0,0,0,,现在磁镭导引已经到手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.17,0:31:55.54,英文,,0,0,0,,the Tianwen Stone is within our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.17,0:31:55.54,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石垂手可得
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.13,0:32:00.17,英文,,0,0,0,,However, one problem stands in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.13,0:32:00.17,中文,,0,0,0,,不过 目前却有一个难题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.38,0:32:02.96,英文,,0,0,0,,What problem is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.38,0:32:02.96,中文,,0,0,0,,是什么难题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.96,0:32:05.96,英文,,0,0,0,,I have investigated Hell Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.96,0:32:05.96,中文,,0,0,0,,为父已经侦查过了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:09.29,英文,,0,0,0,,where the stone is hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.96,0:32:09.29,中文,,0,0,0,,收藏天问石的地狱谷
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.25,0:32:12.67,英文,,0,0,0,,We must pass through a sheer cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.25,0:32:12.67,中文,,0,0,0,,必须通过一处绝崖
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.50,0:32:16.21,英文,,0,0,0,,But the cross bridge was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.50,0:32:16.21,中文,,0,0,0,,可是原来的吊桥已经断了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.29,0:32:21.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Now, only Au-Shiau Hung-Chen is able to cross
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.29,0:32:21.29,中文,,0,0,0,,现在只有傲笑红尘的御剑之术
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.92,0:32:23.62,英文,,0,0,0,,the cliff with his sword skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.92,0:32:23.62,中文,,0,0,0,,才能渡过绝崖
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.50,0:32:30.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing. You should know that I will not be able to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.50,0:32:30.00,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰 你也知为父无法去见傲笑红尘
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.00,0:32:35.58,英文,,0,0,0,,I must rely on you to carry out this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.00,0:32:35.58,中文,,0,0,0,,这件任务 只有交待你了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.25,0:32:38.37,英文,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.25,0:32:38.37,中文,,0,0,0,,女儿尽力而为
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.08,0:32:45.08,英文,,0,0,0,,This is the magnetic compass. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.08,0:32:45.08,中文,,0,0,0,,这是磁镭导引 你拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.13,0:32:54.33,英文,,0,0,0,,And... I saw Su Huan-Jen and the Unkinds appearing at Hell Valley together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.13,0:32:54.33,中文,,0,0,0,,还有 素还真与非善类同时出现在地狱谷
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.33,0:32:58.75,英文,,0,0,0,,It's possible that both of them have reached an agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.33,0:32:58.75,中文,,0,0,0,,有可能他们双方已经达成协议
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:33:01.67,英文,,0,0,0,,to join forces to seize the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:33:01.67,中文,,0,0,0,,想合作夺取天问石
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.38,0:33:06.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Daughter, you have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.38,0:33:06.62,中文,,0,0,0,,女儿 你要多加小心
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.75,0:33:09.46,英文,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.75,0:33:09.46,中文,,0,0,0,,女儿晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.33,0:33:26.50,英文,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you, Senior, I wouldn't have been able to meet Su Huan-Jen face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.33,0:33:26.50,中文,,0,0,0,,感谢前辈出面 如冰才能顺利与素还真见面
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.08,0:33:31.08,英文,,0,0,0,,No need to thank me. It's a small matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.08,0:33:31.08,中文,,0,0,0,,不必说谢 这是小事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.00,0:33:37.21,英文,,0,0,0,,My late father often spoke of you, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.00,0:33:37.21,中文,,0,0,0,,家父生前时常提起前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.33,0:33:41.29,英文,,0,0,0,,I never knew you were so loyal and affectionate to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.33,0:33:41.29,中文,,0,0,0,,原来前辈也对家父有情有义
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.54,0:33:44.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I am really grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.54,0:33:44.67,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰感念在心
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.38,0:33:47.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Your father was a wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.38,0:33:47.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你的父亲超尘绝世
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.92,0:33:54.00,英文,,0,0,0,,In this world, very few people can move me to offer my true friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.92,0:33:54.00,中文,,0,0,0,,在这个世上 能使我倾心结交之人 少之又少
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.67,0:33:57.00,英文,,0,0,0,,I am curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.67,0:33:57.00,中文,,0,0,0,,请容许如冰好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.46,0:34:03.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Our house used to be filled with guests. But why have I never seen you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.46,0:34:03.75,中文,,0,0,0,,家父生前宾客盈门 为何独不见前辈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.96,0:34:09.75,英文,,0,0,0,,That is exactly why. A lavish life of feasts and splendor
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.96,0:34:09.75,中文,,0,0,0,,就是因为宾客盈门 钟鼓馔玉的奢华生活
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.25,0:34:11.75,英文,,0,0,0,,is not in my nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.25,0:34:11.75,中文,,0,0,0,,非我之性
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:15.75,英文,,0,0,0,,My father relished the glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:15.75,中文,,0,0,0,,家父喜爱一呼方诺的风光
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.04,0:34:19.75,英文,,0,0,0,,he could not spend more time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.04,0:34:19.75,中文,,0,0,0,,但是无法与前辈朝夕相处
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.58,0:34:22.75,英文,,0,0,0,,But he also deeply regretted that
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.58,0:34:22.75,中文,,0,0,0,,也一直是他毕生的遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.00,0:34:28.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought that we would never see each other again?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.00,0:34:28.92,中文,,0,0,0,,想不到转眼之间已经天人永隔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.79,0:34:31.25,英文,,0,0,0,,How did your father die?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.79,0:34:31.25,中文,,0,0,0,,令尊是怎样死的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.79,0:34:34.17,英文,,0,0,0,,He died of depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.79,0:34:34.17,中文,,0,0,0,,抑郁身亡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.13,0:34:38.25,英文,,0,0,0,,What depressed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.13,0:34:38.25,中文,,0,0,0,,何事令他抑郁而亡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.13,0:34:43.58,英文,,0,0,0,,He had a lifelong wish that he was not able to fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.13,0:34:43.58,中文,,0,0,0,,他有一项毕生的心愿 未能完成所致
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.33,0:34:47.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Your father wielded heaven-shaking power and possessed riches fit for a nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.33,0:34:47.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你父亲的权势倾天 富可敌国
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.63,0:34:52.04,英文,,0,0,0,,What wish could be so hard that even he could not fulfill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.63,0:34:52.04,中文,,0,0,0,,到底是什么心愿 连他都无法完成
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.08,0:35:01.50,英文,,0,0,0,,While he was alive, he longed to obtain a rare treasure. The Tianwen Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.08,0:35:01.50,中文,,0,0,0,,他生前心心念念 想要取得一样稀世奇珍 天问石
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.46,0:35:04.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Have you fulfilled his wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.46,0:35:04.17,中文,,0,0,0,,你完成了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.46,0:35:06.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.46,0:35:06.75,中文,,0,0,0,,尚未完成
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.92,0:35:12.96,英文,,0,0,0,,I was hoping that Su Huan-Jen could assist with his power and skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.92,0:35:12.96,中文,,0,0,0,,约见素还真 就是为了倚重他的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.29,0:35:18.25,英文,,0,0,0,,But why must he be the one to fulfill your father's dying wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.29,0:35:18.25,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么要他来完成你父亲的遗志
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.25,0:35:25.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Because, in Wulin, he's the one who keeps his strengths hidden the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.25,0:35:25.54,中文,,0,0,0,,因为在武林中 最深藏不露的人就是素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.17,0:35:31.67,英文,,0,0,0,,He is perhaps the most masterful swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.17,0:35:31.67,中文,,0,0,0,,也许他也精通御剑术
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.50,0:35:37.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, your friendship with Su Huan-Jen is profound.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.50,0:35:37.37,中文,,0,0,0,,其次 前辈与素还真交情匪浅
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.92,0:35:38.83,英文,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.92,0:35:38.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.46,0:35:42.37,英文,,0,0,0,,First of all, Su Huan-jen doesn't know any sword stances.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.46,0:35:42.37,中文,,0,0,0,,第一 素还真不会御剑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.25,0:35:46.33,英文,,0,0,0,,And second, I share no acquaintance with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.25,0:35:46.33,中文,,0,0,0,,第二 我与他毫无交情
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.50,0:35:52.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Just mentioning his name would dissipate the spiritual aura of my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.50,0:35:52.33,中文,,0,0,0,,提起这个名字 蒿棘居的灵气荡然也
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.33,0:35:57.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior, do you really hate him that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.33,0:35:57.33,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈如此厌恶素还真吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.13,0:36:00.17,英文,,0,0,0,,"Our Dao diverges; we cannot scheme side by side."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.13,0:36:00.17,中文,,0,0,0,,道不同不相为谋
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.46,0:36:06.25,英文,,0,0,0,,My house should no longer be contaminated by Wulin's stench.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.46,0:36:06.25,中文,,0,0,0,,蒿棘居不该再染上江湖腥秽
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.13,0:36:10.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Let me use my lyre to cleanse away the vulgarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.13,0:36:10.37,中文,,0,0,0,,让我以筝声清涤俗气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.96,0:36:12.83,英文,,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.96,0:36:12.83,中文,,0,0,0,,洗耳恭听
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.08,0:36:36.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother Su is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.08,0:36:36.62,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥情況危急
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.29,0:36:40.96,英文,,0,0,0,,But Senior is playing his lyre, so it's not prudent to disturb him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.29,0:36:40.96,中文,,0,0,0,,但是前辈引筝之际 不宜贸然打断
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.75,0:36:43.37,英文,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.75,0:36:43.37,中文,,0,0,0,,这如何是好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.25,0:36:53.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Ching Yang-Zi. Why are you standing outside? Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.25,0:36:53.67,中文,,0,0,0,,青阳子 何必伫立在外 进入吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.63,0:36:58.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.63,0:36:58.67,中文,,0,0,0,,青阳见过前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.00,0:37:04.67,英文,,0,0,0,,One does not visit without a purpose. Just say what's on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.00,0:37:04.67,中文,,0,0,0,,无事不登三宝殿 就开门见山说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.63,0:37:06.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.63,0:37:06.04,中文,,0,0,0,,这...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.67,0:37:09.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing here is not a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.67,0:37:09.04,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰又不是外人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.38,0:37:12.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Please don't misunderstand, Senior. The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.38,0:37:12.33,中文,,0,0,0,,请前辈不要误会 实在是...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.71,0:37:15.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Is Su Huan-Jen in peril?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.71,0:37:15.00,中文,,0,0,0,,是不是素还真有难
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.75,0:37:16.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.75,0:37:16.25,中文,,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.13,0:37:20.00,英文,,0,0,0,,He's trapped at Hell Valley. He's in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.13,0:37:20.00,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥被困地狱谷 危及累卵
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.71,0:37:22.58,英文,,0,0,0,,I was about to head to Hell Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.71,0:37:22.58,中文,,0,0,0,,吾正要前往地狱谷
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.96,0:37:24.58,英文,,0,0,0,,but not to save Su Huan-Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.96,0:37:24.58,中文,,0,0,0,,但不是要救素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.42,0:37:27.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I was going to fulfill Ru-Bing's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.42,0:37:27.67,中文,,0,0,0,,而是要完成如冰的心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.46,0:37:32.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes. Please follow me, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.46,0:37:32.17,中文,,0,0,0,,是 是 前辈快隨我来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.33,0:37:41.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother, Senior is here to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.33,0:37:41.83,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥 前辈来救你了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.71,0:37:46.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I shall remember forever your gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.71,0:37:46.67,中文,,0,0,0,,此恩此德 素某永铭五内
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.83,0:37:51.92,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm here today to help Ru-Bing cross the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.83,0:37:51.92,中文,,0,0,0,,我今天来意 是助如冰姑娘到对岸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.25,0:37:53.37,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.25,0:37:53.37,中文,,0,0,0,,而不是来救你的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.38,0:37:56.46,英文,,0,0,0,,But me and my sword can stay a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.38,0:37:56.46,中文,,0,0,0,,不过我的剑可以多留片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.29,0:37:58.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Ru-Bing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.29,0:37:58.87,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰你准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.25,0:38:01.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.25,0:38:01.37,中文,,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.71,0:38:06.08,英文,,0,0,0,,The melding of the heart and sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.71,0:38:06.08,中文,,0,0,0,,心剑融合
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.83,0:38:10.67,英文,,0,0,0,,The sword leaves at the heart's will. The sword arrives whenever the heart wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.83,0:38:10.67,中文,,0,0,0,,心行即剑行 心至即剑至
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.42,0:38:22.79,英文,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.42,0:38:22.79,中文,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.38,0:38:33.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen is my mortal enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.38,0:38:33.33,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真与我有血海深仇
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.63,0:38:36.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Should I rescue him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.63,0:38:36.54,中文,,0,0,0,,我要帮他脱离困境吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.50,0:38:43.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Lady Jian, you must leave here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.50,0:38:43.17,中文,,0,0,0,,剑姑娘快快离开
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.71,0:38:46.79,英文,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous here. Traps are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.71,0:38:46.79,中文,,0,0,0,,此地机关重重 危机四伏
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.50,0:38:53.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen, you should leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.50,0:38:53.96,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.96,0:38:57.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior and his sword will not stay here for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.96,0:38:57.33,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈的剑是不会停留太久的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.83,0:39:01.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Miss. why is the magnetic compass in your possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.83,0:39:01.75,中文,,0,0,0,,姑娘 为什么磁镭导引会在你的身上
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.54,0:39:05.67,英文,,0,0,0,,In this world, there are many unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.54,0:39:05.67,中文,,0,0,0,,世间上有很多无法解答的为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.13,0:39:07.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.13,0:39:07.33,中文,,0,0,0,,你快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.46,0:39:10.25,英文,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.46,0:39:10.25,中文,,0,0,0,,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.42,0:39:16.62,英文,,0,0,0,,I must go in and get the stone and fulfill my late father's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.42,0:39:16.62,中文,,0,0,0,,进去取得天问石 完成家父遗愿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.25,0:39:21.42,英文,,0,0,0,,The sword has started its return path. If you don't leave now, it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.25,0:39:21.42,中文,,0,0,0,,回程之剑已启动 再不走就走不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:48.96,英文,,0,0,0,,It's the Tianwen Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:48.96,中文,,0,0,0,,是天问石
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.54,0:39:53.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Great! I have finally found the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.54,0:39:53.37,中文,,0,0,0,,太好了 我终于找到天问石了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.00,0:40:00.92,英文,,0,0,0,,I had better be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.00,0:40:00.92,中文,,0,0,0,,还是谨慎为妙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.04,0:40:38.00,英文,,0,0,0,,It's indeed an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.04,0:40:38.00,中文,,0,0,0,,果然是幻影
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.92,0:40:47.87,英文,,0,0,0,,This should be genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.92,0:40:47.87,中文,,0,0,0,,现在应该就是真货了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.71,0:40:56.67,英文,,0,0,0,,What... What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.71,0:40:56.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这这又是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:46.58,英文,,0,0,0,,She's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.00,0:41:46.58,中文,,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.29,0:42:19.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.29,0:42:19.08,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.00,0:42:21.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.00,0:42:21.50,中文,,0,0,0,,去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.96,0:43:59.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.96,0:43:59.96,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.88,0:44:02.96,英文,,0,0,0,,I thought you were already...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.88,0:44:02.96,中文,,0,0,0,,我以为前辈你已经...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.17,0:44:04.37,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.17,0:44:04.37,中文,,0,0,0,,我平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.83,0:44:05.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.83,0:44:05.83,中文,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.83,0:44:11.00,英文,,0,0,0,,How can I repay you, Senior, for saving my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.83,0:44:11.00,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈救命之恩 侄女不知如何
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.00,0:44:13.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.00,0:44:13.00,中文,,0,0,0,,不必再说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.29,0:44:17.37,英文,,0,0,0,,If you still respect me as your Senior, then stop talking about repaying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.29,0:44:17.37,中文,,0,0,0,,若尊敬我是你的前辈 就休提报恩之事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.63,0:44:18.37,英文,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.63,0:44:18.37,中文,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.08,0:44:21.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing. Did you retrieve the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.08,0:44:21.83,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰 天问石可有取得
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.42,0:44:22.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.42,0:44:22.92,中文,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.75,0:44:27.00,英文,,0,0,0,,You have accomplished your father's wish and fulfilled your filial duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.75,0:44:27.00,中文,,0,0,0,,令尊的遗愿达成 你已尽孝道
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.71,0:44:35.00,英文,,0,0,0,,It's because of your help, Senior, that I was able to complete my late father's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.71,0:44:35.00,中文,,0,0,0,,全赖前辈大力相助 侄女方能如此顺利完成先父遗愿
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:37.42,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm forever grateful...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:37.42,中文,,0,0,0,,此恩此德
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.79,0:44:40.08,英文,,0,0,0,,There you go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.79,0:44:40.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你又客套了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.54,0:44:45.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Lady Jian. May I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.54,0:44:45.83,中文,,0,0,0,,剑姑娘 素某有一事请教
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.25,0:44:47.46,英文,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.25,0:44:47.46,中文,,0,0,0,,什么事情
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.25,0:44:51.12,英文,,0,0,0,,Are you aware of the taboo of using the Tianwen Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.25,0:44:51.12,中文,,0,0,0,,姑娘可知使用天问石的禁忌
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.50,0:44:56.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Whoever makes wishes to the stone will have their wishes granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.50,0:44:56.04,中文,,0,0,0,,以天问石许愿 可以达成任何的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.38,0:45:00.54,英文,,0,0,0,,But, the person that makes the wishes must pay the price by giving up his or her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.38,0:45:00.54,中文,,0,0,0,,但是这名许愿之人必须以自己的性命作为代价
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.04,0:45:01.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.04,0:45:01.87,中文,,0,0,0,,有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.17,0:45:03.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Every word I said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.17,0:45:03.29,中文,,0,0,0,,句句属实
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.17,0:45:06.79,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. That's not your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.17,0:45:06.79,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 不用你担心
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.33,0:45:08.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Heaven will protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.33,0:45:08.67,中文,,0,0,0,,上苍会保佑她没事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.00,0:45:11.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing, I'll escort you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.00,0:45:11.67,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰 我送你回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.25,0:45:13.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.25,0:45:13.87,中文,,0,0,0,,多谢前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.50,0:45:19.67,英文,,0,0,0,,With his protection, every danger can be averted.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.50,0:45:19.67,中文,,0,0,0,,有前辈保护 任何危机皆可化险为夷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.46,0:45:22.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother, we should go back too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.46,0:45:22.75,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥 我们也该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.29,0:45:23.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.29,0:45:23.96,中文,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.75,0:45:25.75,英文,,0,0,0,,What's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.75,0:45:25.75,中文,,0,0,0,,何事奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.46,0:45:30.12,英文,,0,0,0,,Why would Jian Ru-Bing have the magnetic compass?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.46,0:45:30.12,中文,,0,0,0,,为何磁镭导引会在剑如冰的身上
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.75,0:45:32.96,英文,,0,0,0,,If she is capable of retrieving the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.75,0:45:32.96,中文,,0,0,0,,既然她有能力取得天问石
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.58,0:45:36.46,英文,,0,0,0,,then why would she need to talk to me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.58,0:45:36.46,中文,,0,0,0,,当初又何必约我到冷香水榭
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.83,0:45:39.67,英文,,0,0,0,,about the stone and the Unkinds?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.83,0:45:39.67,中文,,0,0,0,,谈论天问石与非善类之事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.42,0:45:41.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother, you are overthinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.42,0:45:41.67,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥你太多心了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.25,0:45:45.50,英文,,0,0,0,,The stone has been retrieved, so the matter is resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.25,0:45:45.50,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石已被取出 事情已告一段落
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.21,0:45:48.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Ching Yang, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.21,0:45:48.21,中文,,0,0,0,,青阳 你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.67,0:45:51.92,英文,,0,0,0,,The real calamity is only getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.67,0:45:51.92,中文,,0,0,0,,真正的事情 现在才要开始
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.13,0:46:10.25,英文,,0,0,0,,The sorrowful fallen leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.13,0:46:10.25,中文,,0,0,0,,悲落叶
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.08,0:46:13.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Drift down in fluttering layers,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.08,0:46:13.33,中文,,0,0,0,,联翩下重叠
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.75,0:46:16.79,英文,,0,0,0,,falling yet still flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.75,0:46:16.79,中文,,0,0,0,,重叠落且飞
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.67,0:46:19.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Never to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.67,0:46:19.75,中文,,0,0,0,,纵横去不归
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.83,0:46:26.17,英文,,0,0,0,,You have obtained the Tianwen Stone and fulfilled your father's dying wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.83,0:46:26.17,中文,,0,0,0,,你得到天问石 就能完成你父亲的遗志
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.79,0:46:28.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Why are you still so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.79,0:46:28.83,中文,,0,0,0,,为何如此伤感
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.04,0:46:36.42,英文,,0,0,0,,Seeing the stone reminds me of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.04,0:46:36.42,中文,,0,0,0,,看到天问石 就想起亡父
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.54,0:46:43.21,英文,,0,0,0,,All those memories. I can still feel the warmth in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.54,0:46:43.21,中文,,0,0,0,,忆起往事 人间温情处处是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.29,0:46:45.33,英文,,0,0,0,,But one thing is still missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.29,0:46:45.33,中文,,0,0,0,,唯吾独缺
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:48.29,英文,,0,0,0,,And that's my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:48.29,中文,,0,0,0,,父亲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.71,0:46:54.67,英文,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.71,0:46:54.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.08,0:46:57.87,英文,,0,0,0,,It's the stance to freeze water into ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.08,0:46:57.87,中文,,0,0,0,,凝水成冰的功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.75,0:47:01.92,英文,,0,0,0,,When you were a little girl, I used this stance
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.75,0:47:01.92,中文,,0,0,0,,你小时候 我曾用这部功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.63,0:47:05.62,英文,,0,0,0,,to make icy pearls, and offered them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.63,0:47:05.62,中文,,0,0,0,,将露水凝结成冰柱送给你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.88,0:47:07.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.88,0:47:07.04,中文,,0,0,0,,难道你忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.33,0:47:09.62,英文,,0,0,0,,I have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.33,0:47:09.62,中文,,0,0,0,,我没忘却
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.50,0:47:16.54,英文,,0,0,0,,I will never, ever, forget this memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.50,0:47:16.54,中文,,0,0,0,,我对这段回忆 永远都不会忘却
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.29,0:47:20.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.29,0:47:20.83,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.00,0:47:30.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.00,0:47:30.08,中文,,0,0,0,,保重了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.67,0:47:41.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior... I really wish you could stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.67,0:47:41.58,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈 我真的希望你能留下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.67,0:48:17.37,英文,,0,0,0,,The Tianwen Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.67,0:48:17.37,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.25,0:48:28.71,英文,,0,0,0,,My long-cherished wish of many years is finally about to be fulfilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.25,0:48:28.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我多年的心愿 终要达成了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.42,0:48:34.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing. You did very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.42,0:48:34.17,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰 你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.21,0:48:38.04,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.21,0:48:38.04,中文,,0,0,0,,为父非常高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.71,0:48:41.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad... There is something...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.71,0:48:41.54,中文,,0,0,0,,爹亲 有一件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.54,0:48:46.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, we'll talk about it later. I have to make a wish first.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.54,0:48:46.54,中文,,0,0,0,,有什么事稍后再说 为父要先许愿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.21,0:48:48.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.21,0:48:48.96,中文,,0,0,0,,爹 不可呀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.25,0:48:52.75,英文,,0,0,0,,What are you doing??
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.25,0:48:52.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.96,0:48:57.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.96,0:48:57.25,中文,,0,0,0,,爹 原谅女儿的冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.75,0:49:00.29,英文,,0,0,0,,But Su Huan-Jen told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.75,0:49:00.29,中文,,0,0,0,,可是素还真向我说过
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.79,0:49:02.87,英文,,0,0,0,,that whoever makes a wish to the Tianwen Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.79,0:49:02.87,中文,,0,0,0,,只要向天问石许愿的人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.46,0:49:06.75,英文,,0,0,0,,must sacrifice one's life as the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.46,0:49:06.75,中文,,0,0,0,,必须付出自己的性命作为代价
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.38,0:49:10.54,英文,,0,0,0,,That means the stone will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.38,0:49:10.54,中文,,0,0,0,,也就是许愿者必死无疑
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.54,0:49:16.67,英文,,0,0,0,,What? When did he say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.54,0:49:16.67,中文,,0,0,0,,什么 他是什么时候说的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.17,0:49:20.17,英文,,0,0,0,,After I obtained the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.17,0:49:20.17,中文,,0,0,0,,在女儿取得天问石之后
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.25,0:49:21.75,英文,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.25,0:49:21.75,中文,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.75,0:49:26.08,英文,,0,0,0,,That was Su Huan-Jen trying to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.75,0:49:26.08,中文,,0,0,0,,这是素还真危言耸听
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.63,0:49:28.21,英文,,0,0,0,,How can you believe him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.63,0:49:28.21,中文,,0,0,0,,怎可相信
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.79,0:49:29.33,英文,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.79,0:49:29.33,中文,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.71,0:49:32.42,英文,,0,0,0,,Enough! You go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.71,0:49:32.42,中文,,0,0,0,,罢了 你先出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.04,0:49:35.25,英文,,0,0,0,,As your father, I have my own judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.04,0:49:35.25,中文,,0,0,0,,为父自有主张
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.50,0:49:37.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.50,0:49:37.04,中文,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.17,0:49:38.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.17,0:49:38.87,中文,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.71,0:49:42.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Did Su Huan-Jen see the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.71,0:49:42.83,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真有看到天问石吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.33,0:49:43.96,英文,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.33,0:49:43.96,中文,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.25,0:49:47.67,英文,,0,0,0,,You may leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.25,0:49:47.67,中文,,0,0,0,,下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.50,0:50:01.33,英文,,0,0,0,,The wish maker will die? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.50,0:50:01.33,中文,,0,0,0,,许愿者必死无疑 是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.21,0:50:06.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Is Su Huan-Jen bluffing?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.21,0:50:06.33,中文,,0,0,0,,这是素还真在胡说
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.75,0:50:08.62,英文,,0,0,0,,It can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.75,0:50:08.62,中文,,0,0,0,,绝对没有这种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.25,0:50:14.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Tianwen Stone. Please grant my wish of...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.25,0:50:14.87,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石 请完成我的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.25,0:50:16.92,英文,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.25,0:50:16.92,中文,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.25,0:50:21.00,英文,,0,0,0,,What if Su was telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.25,0:50:21.00,中文,,0,0,0,,万一素还真所言是真
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.92,0:50:26.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Then all of my hard work would be in vain. This...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.92,0:50:26.00,中文,,0,0,0,,那我所有的心血不就白费了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.75,0:50:30.62,英文,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.75,0:50:30.62,中文,,0,0,0,,这 这该如何是好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.54,0:50:35.87,英文,,0,0,0,,There are already many people who knew I've got the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.54,0:50:35.87,中文,,0,0,0,,现在已经有很多人知道我得到此石
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.46,0:50:39.87,英文,,0,0,0,,If I don't make a wish now, the stone might be seized.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.46,0:50:39.87,中文,,0,0,0,,若没赶紧许愿 万一被夺
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.54,0:50:43.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Yet... I can't make a wish for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.54,0:50:43.87,中文,,0,0,0,,可是 我又不能自己许愿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.33,0:50:46.87,英文,,0,0,0,,If I asked Ru-Bing or Jian-Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.33,0:50:46.87,中文,,0,0,0,,若是交给如冰或者剑卫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.50,0:50:50.87,英文,,0,0,0,,are they willing to sacrifice their lives for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.50,0:50:50.87,中文,,0,0,0,,他们有可能愿意替我牺牲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.54,0:50:56.87,英文,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.54,0:50:56.87,中文,,0,0,0,,这该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.46,0:51:07.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Whether Su Huan-Jen was lying or telling the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.46,0:51:07.87,中文,,0,0,0,,不管素还真讲这句话是真是假
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.71,0:51:12.33,英文,,0,0,0,,his true intention was to restrain my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.71,0:51:12.33,中文,,0,0,0,,他的用意就是牵制我的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.38,0:51:18.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Looks like Su himself has been coveting the stone for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.38,0:51:18.87,中文,,0,0,0,,看来素还真对天问石也早就凯觎多时
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.54,0:51:21.54,英文,,0,0,0,,And thus preventing me from making my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.54,0:51:21.54,中文,,0,0,0,,因而阻挡我许愿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.54,0:51:26.12,英文,,0,0,0,,I'll come after you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.54,0:51:26.12,中文,,0,0,0,,哼 我就先针对你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.50,0:51:29.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.50,0:51:29.04,中文,,0,0,0,,素 还 真
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.08,0:51:32.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Jian-Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.08,0:51:32.33,中文,,0,0,0,,剑卫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.29,0:51:35.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.29,0:51:35.04,中文,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.96,0:51:40.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Get Lan-Shin here! And don't let Ru-Bing know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.96,0:51:40.83,中文,,0,0,0,,将兰心叫来 勿让如冰知晓
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.58,0:51:42.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.58,0:51:42.33,中文,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.75,0:51:46.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Lan-Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.75,0:51:46.83,中文,,0,0,0,,兰心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.88,0:51:55.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Take this letter to Liuli Fairyland. Give it to Su Huan-Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.88,0:51:55.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你将此信送到琉璃仙境 交给素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.13,0:51:56.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.13,0:51:56.92,中文,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.54,0:52:08.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Now, we'll just have to wait and see if the Unkinds fall into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.54,0:52:08.92,中文,,0,0,0,,再来就看非善类是否中计了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.58,0:52:41.58,英文,,0,0,0,,"Mr. Gu-Pi (Skin and Bones) will return the stone to Su Huan-Jen
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.58,0:52:41.58,中文,,0,0,0,,骨皮先生要在明天二十四日
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.25,0:52:45.33,英文,,0,0,0,,tomorrow, on the 24th."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.25,0:52:45.33,中文,,0,0,0,,将天问石交予素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.67,0:52:54.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll disguise as Su Huan-Jen and make the appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.67,0:52:54.54,中文,,0,0,0,,好 就让我这个素还真前去赴约吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.25,0:53:03.62,英文,,0,0,0,,What? Dad, you're giving the stone to Su Huan-Jen?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.25,0:53:03.62,中文,,0,0,0,,什么 爹要将天问石交予素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.63,0:53:05.54,英文,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.63,0:53:05.54,中文,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.67,0:53:08.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Aren't you still angry at him
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.67,0:53:08.87,中文,,0,0,0,,爹不是对素还真当年
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.54,0:53:15.25,英文,,0,0,0,,for not saving us at the old villa back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.54,0:53:15.25,中文,,0,0,0,,对咱山庄见死不救的事情一直耿耿于怀吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.38,0:53:21.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to give such an important thing to him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.38,0:53:21.00,中文,,0,0,0,,为何现在又要将这么重要的东西交给他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.67,0:53:27.12,英文,,0,0,0,,I can't live in the past. Just because Su didn't save us
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.67,0:53:27.12,中文,,0,0,0,,为父总不能因为素还真以前没帮助咱们
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.75,0:53:31.00,英文,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean I should disregard the safety of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.75,0:53:31.00,中文,,0,0,0,,就不顾天下苍生的安危
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.08,0:53:36.58,英文,,0,0,0,,The Unkinds are a big threat to Wulin and even all humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.08,0:53:36.58,中文,,0,0,0,,非善类对武林 甚至全人类的危害
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.46,0:53:41.46,英文,,0,0,0,,They will inflict even more harm just like they did to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.46,0:53:41.46,中文,,0,0,0,,将会造成更多像鸣剑山庄的不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.63,0:53:49.58,英文,,0,0,0,,As your father, I have felt this pain firsthand. That's why I decided to give the Tianwen Stone to Su Huan-Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.63,0:53:49.58,中文,,0,0,0,,为父有着切心之痛 才决定将天问石交给素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.92,0:53:57.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Hopefully he is as benevolent and virtuous a gentleman as he is said to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.92,0:53:57.00,中文,,0,0,0,,但愿素还真是一个如外所传的仁人君子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.25,0:54:01.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Then I will not have wasted my heartfelt intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.25,0:54:01.00,中文,,0,0,0,,也不枉费我的一片心意
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.75,0:54:07.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing. Your father is doing this entirely for the sake of the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.75,0:54:07.50,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰 为父这样做完全是为着大局着想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.46,0:54:13.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Father, you are both kind and selfless. As your daughter, I am willing to share the burden
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.46,0:54:13.67,中文,,0,0,0,,爹亲公而忘私 女儿愿意分担其劳
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.79,0:54:18.33,英文,,0,0,0,,and escort the stone to Liuli Fairyland.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.79,0:54:18.33,中文,,0,0,0,,护送天问石到琉璃仙境
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.58,0:54:19.33,英文,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.58,0:54:19.33,中文,,0,0,0,,不可
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.17,0:54:22.33,英文,,0,0,0,,The Unkinds are eyeing the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.17,0:54:22.33,中文,,0,0,0,,非善类虎视眈眈
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.83,0:54:25.54,英文,,0,0,0,,It's far too risky for you to make this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.83,0:54:25.54,中文,,0,0,0,,由你来走这趟路太冒险了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.50,0:54:29.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Why don't you write Su on my behalf and invite him
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.50,0:54:29.92,中文,,0,0,0,,不如你发函代为父邀请素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.79,0:54:34.04,英文,,0,0,0,,to come here tomorrow on the 25th so we can meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.79,0:54:34.04,中文,,0,0,0,,明天二十五日来此与吾会面
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.79,0:54:36.75,英文,,0,0,0,,I will do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.79,0:54:36.75,中文,,0,0,0,,女儿遵办
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.25,0:54:41.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Jian-Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.25,0:54:41.17,中文,,0,0,0,,剑卫
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.42,0:54:43.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.42,0:54:43.33,中文,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.58,0:54:44.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.58,0:54:44.92,中文,,0,0,0,,附耳来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.79,0:54:46.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.79,0:54:46.58,中文,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.21,0:54:51.71,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.21,0:54:51.71,中文,,0,0,0,,属下遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.25,0:55:00.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Lady Jian.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.25,0:55:00.25,中文,,0,0,0,,剑姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.00,0:55:03.79,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen, Ching Yang-Zi.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.00,0:55:03.79,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 青阳子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.88,0:55:09.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. Before I hand you the invitation,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.88,0:55:09.17,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 在你接受这张请帖之前
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.04,0:55:12.29,英文,,0,0,0,,you must promise me two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.04,0:55:12.29,中文,,0,0,0,,务必答应我两件事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.83,0:55:15.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Tell me. I will promise you for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.83,0:55:15.67,中文,,0,0,0,,请说 素某一定答应
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.00,0:55:19.67,英文,,0,0,0,,But I haven't even told you what they are. And you've already promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.00,0:55:19.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我尚未讲出是哪两件 你就答应
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.21,0:55:21.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a bit too confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.21,0:55:21.87,中文,,0,0,0,,是不是太有自信了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.29,0:55:23.87,英文,,0,0,0,,It's quite clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.29,0:55:23.87,中文,,0,0,0,,素某一目了然
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.17,0:55:27.58,英文,,0,0,0,,First, you want me to go there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.17,0:55:27.58,中文,,0,0,0,,第一件 是不是要素某单独赴约
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.13,0:55:28.87,英文,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.13,0:55:28.87,中文,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.50,0:55:30.71,英文,,0,0,0,,What about the second thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.50,0:55:30.71,中文,,0,0,0,,那第二件呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.00,0:55:35.25,英文,,0,0,0,,The second is the person who invited me would like to keep his identity a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.00,0:55:35.25,中文,,0,0,0,,第二件就是发帖之人要求对他的身份保密
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.13,0:55:39.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen, you truly are extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.13,0:55:39.25,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真你果然非同凡响
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.00,0:55:42.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Please, you must honor your promise for these two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.00,0:55:42.67,中文,,0,0,0,,请你一定要遵守这两个要求
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:45.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I always keep my promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:45.67,中文,,0,0,0,,君子一诺千金
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.96,0:55:46.71,英文,,0,0,0,,I take my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.96,0:55:46.71,中文,,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.04,0:55:50.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Brother, can you tell me what's going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.04,0:55:50.67,中文,,0,0,0,,大哥你可以说明了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.63,0:55:54.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Someone wants to gift me the Tianwen Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.63,0:55:54.17,中文,,0,0,0,,有人要将天问石移赠于我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.17,0:55:57.17,英文,,0,0,0,,I thought the stone is in Lady Jian's possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.17,0:55:57.17,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石不是在剑姑娘的手上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.71,0:55:59.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Why didn't she just bring it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.71,0:55:59.17,中文,,0,0,0,,为何她不亲自送来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.79,0:56:02.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Could it be... that someone is really behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.79,0:56:02.04,中文,,0,0,0,,难道幕后真的有人控制一切
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.46,0:56:03.33,英文,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.46,0:56:03.33,中文,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.08,0:56:08.33,英文,,0,0,0,,But, as you saw just now, I promised Lady Jian two things. And you heard what they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.08,0:56:08.33,中文,,0,0,0,,但是方才我承诺剑姑娘的两件事 你也听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.71,0:56:10.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I have to keep this person's identity a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.71,0:56:10.67,中文,,0,0,0,,对此人的身份保密
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.50,0:56:13.04,英文,,0,0,0,,What if it's a trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.50,0:56:13.04,中文,,0,0,0,,万一这是一个阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:18.46,英文,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Once all is in the clear, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:18.46,中文,,0,0,0,,你放心 等一切查清之后 我会向你讲明
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.88,0:56:20.04,英文,,0,0,0,,When do you need to be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.88,0:56:20.04,中文,,0,0,0,,什么时候赴约
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.75,0:56:23.00,英文,,0,0,0,,It says the 25th on the invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.75,0:56:23.00,中文,,0,0,0,,请帖注明是二十五日
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.92,0:56:26.33,英文,,0,0,0,,That's the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.92,0:56:26.33,中文,,0,0,0,,应该是后天
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.54,0:56:42.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. You've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.54,0:56:42.25,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 你来了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.25,0:56:46.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes. I came at your invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.25,0:56:46.29,中文,,0,0,0,,是 劣者应邀而来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.00,0:56:50.29,英文,,0,0,0,,I've heard that you intend to hand over the Tianwen Stone to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.00,0:56:50.29,中文,,0,0,0,,听闻先生有意将天问石交予在下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.63,0:56:51.29,英文,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.63,0:56:51.29,中文,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.25,0:56:54.71,英文,,0,0,0,,And here's the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.25,0:56:54.71,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石在此
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.17,0:57:02.75,英文,,0,0,0,,I wonder how the conversation is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.17,0:57:02.75,中文,,0,0,0,,不知爹亲与素还真谈了如何
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.83,0:57:05.67,英文,,0,0,0,,It's really worrying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.83,0:57:05.67,中文,,0,0,0,,真是令人担心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.92,0:57:10.42,英文,,0,0,0,,My lady, if you're worried about Master's safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.92,0:57:10.42,中文,,0,0,0,,小姐 如果掛心主人的安危
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.21,0:57:13.54,英文,,0,0,0,,allow me to take you there through the secret tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.21,0:57:13.54,中文,,0,0,0,,不如让属下带你由密道一观吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.29,0:57:16.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Good! You will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.29,0:57:16.54,中文,,0,0,0,,好 你马上带路
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.71,0:57:18.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.71,0:57:18.92,中文,,0,0,0,,请随我来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.00,0:57:27.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. Does seeing the Tianwen Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.00,0:57:27.83,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 看到天问石
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.83,0:57:31.33,英文,,0,0,0,,excite you greatly?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.83,0:57:31.33,中文,,0,0,0,,你十分的激动 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.25,0:57:34.83,英文,,0,0,0,,This Tianwen Stone is fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.25,0:57:34.83,中文,,0,0,0,,这颗天问石是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.29,0:57:38.75,英文,,0,0,0,,How do you know it's fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.29,0:57:38.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎知是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.00,0:57:40.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.00,0:57:40.75,中文,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.83,0:57:43.96,英文,,0,0,0,,You can stop pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.83,0:57:43.96,中文,,0,0,0,,你不用再装蒜了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.00,0:57:47.96,英文,,0,0,0,,You're not the real Su Huan-Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.00,0:57:47.96,中文,,0,0,0,,你不是真正的素还真
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.79,0:57:52.00,英文,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'll give the stone to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.79,0:57:52.00,中文,,0,0,0,,我没可能将天问石交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.00,0:57:55.58,英文,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.00,0:57:55.58,中文,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.38,0:57:57.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.38,0:57:57.58,中文,,0,0,0,,惊讶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.46,0:58:02.96,英文,,0,0,0,,I know exactly who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.46,0:58:02.96,中文,,0,0,0,,你是什么身份 我一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.25,0:58:06.96,英文,,0,0,0,,You... Who are you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.25,0:58:06.96,中文,,0,0,0,,你 你究竟是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.17,0:58:09.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.17,0:58:09.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.29,0:58:18.75,英文,,0,0,0,,I am Jian Shang-Chin,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.29,0:58:18.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我就是剑上卿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.75,0:58:22.67,英文,,0,0,0,,master of the Mingjian (Singing Sword) Villa!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.75,0:58:22.67,中文,,0,0,0,,当年鸣剑山庄之主
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.00,0:58:27.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.00,0:58:27.62,中文,,0,0,0,,爹
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.13,0:58:28.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.13,0:58:28.75,中文,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.75,0:58:32.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.75,0:58:32.37,中文,,0,0,0,,爹
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.46,0:58:34.37,英文,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.46,0:58:34.37,中文,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.96,0:58:38.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.96,0:58:38.54,中文,,0,0,0,,爹 爹亲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.46,0:58:41.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Miss, my condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.46,0:58:41.96,中文,,0,0,0,,小姐 请节哀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.54,0:58:45.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Now, you should seek help from Au-Shiau Hung-Chen at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.54,0:58:45.37,中文,,0,0,0,,现在你应该赶紧去向傲笑红尘求助
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.96,0:58:48.42,英文,,0,0,0,,Ask him to stop Su Huan-Jen from using the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.96,0:58:48.42,中文,,0,0,0,,阻止素还真使用天问石
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.79,0:58:51.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Allow me to handle my lord's funeral matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.79,0:58:51.92,中文,,0,0,0,,主人的后事 就交给属下来处理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.54,0:58:57.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad! You died such a tragic death.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.54,0:58:57.67,中文,,0,0,0,,爹亲啊 您死得好慘啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.75,0:59:01.71,英文,,0,0,0,,I will avenge you for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.75,0:59:01.71,中文,,0,0,0,,女儿一定会替你报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.88,0:59:21.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.88,0:59:21.37,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰发生了何事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.29,0:59:27.75,英文,,0,0,0,,I have come here for a favor, Senior. I want revenge for my father's death!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.29,0:59:27.75,中文,,0,0,0,,请前辈做主 为家父报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.75,0:59:31.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Get up. Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.75,0:59:31.00,中文,,0,0,0,,起来吧 你慢慢讲
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.96,0:59:36.46,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen was merciless.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.96,0:59:36.46,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真心狠手辣
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.33,0:59:40.83,英文,,0,0,0,,He murdered my father to save his own reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.33,0:59:40.83,中文,,0,0,0,,为了自己的声誉 杀害家父
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.29,0:59:43.33,英文,,0,0,0,,I thought your father died a long time ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.29,0:59:43.33,中文,,0,0,0,,你的父亲不是早就逝世了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.63,0:59:50.00,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I lied, Senior. It was too hard for me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.63,0:59:50.00,中文,,0,0,0,,我不敢欺瞒前辈 当初变生突然
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.83,0:59:53.25,英文,,0,0,0,,While trying to eliminate the Unkinds,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.83,0:59:53.25,中文,,0,0,0,,我的父亲为了消灭非善类
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.96,0:59:58.50,英文,,0,0,0,,my father was injured so severely, his appearance changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.96,0:59:58.50,中文,,0,0,0,,确实被打成重伤 而产生变化
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.42,1:00:05.75,英文,,0,0,0,,He became as thin as a skeleton. He looked more ghost than human.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.42,1:00:05.75,中文,,0,0,0,,形销骨立三分像人 七分像鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.21,1:00:12.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Other villagers thought he was possessed by evil spirits,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.21,1:00:12.25,中文,,0,0,0,,众人以为父亲被鬼附身 会带来不祥的妖气
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.13,1:00:14.87,英文,,0,0,0,,so they ambushed our house.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.13,1:00:14.87,中文,,0,0,0,,而围攻我一家
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.50,1:00:16.46,英文,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.50,1:00:16.46,中文,,0,0,0,,后来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.75,1:00:20.42,英文,,0,0,0,,My father and I survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.75,1:00:20.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我与家父侥幸偷生
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.29,1:00:23.75,英文,,0,0,0,,But he has been depressed ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.29,1:00:23.75,中文,,0,0,0,,家父从此心灰意冷
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.29,1:00:27.50,英文,,0,0,0,,He called himself Mr. Gu-Pi
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.29,1:00:27.50,中文,,0,0,0,,自号骨皮先生
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.46,1:00:30.83,英文,,0,0,0,,and hid in a cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.46,1:00:30.83,中文,,0,0,0,,过着不见天日的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.83,1:00:37.54,英文,,0,0,0,,My father wanted me to tell you that he was dead. But he didn't mean to lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.83,1:00:37.54,中文,,0,0,0,,父亲命我转达你他已经身亡 并不是存心要骗你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.25,1:00:39.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Mr. Gu-Pi...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.25,1:00:39.67,中文,,0,0,0,,骨皮先生
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.71,1:00:43.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Shang-Chin, why did you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.71,1:00:43.75,中文,,0,0,0,,上卿 你是何苦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.54,1:00:47.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Even though my father was filled with hatred,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.54,1:00:47.17,中文,,0,0,0,,家父虽然怀恨在心
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.79,1:00:50.17,英文,,0,0,0,,he also knew that Su Huan-Jen
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.79,1:00:50.17,中文,,0,0,0,,但是他得到天问石之后
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.50,1:00:54.87,英文,,0,0,0,,wanted to seize the Tianwen Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.50,1:00:54.87,中文,,0,0,0,,知道素还真也有意夺取
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.33,1:01:00.75,英文,,0,0,0,,So, for the sake of Wulin, he was willing to put his hatred aside
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.33,1:01:00.75,中文,,0,0,0,,为了武林大局 他甘愿放下仇恨
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.46,1:01:04.46,英文,,0,0,0,,and let Su Huan-Jen have the stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.46,1:01:04.46,中文,,0,0,0,,将天问石交给素还真
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.96,1:01:06.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Who would've thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.96,1:01:06.17,中文,,0,0,0,,想不到
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.25,1:01:11.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Did you see Su Huan-Jen do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.25,1:01:11.04,中文,,0,0,0,,你有亲眼看见素还真动手吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.79,1:01:12.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.79,1:01:12.50,中文,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.50,1:01:13.46,英文,,0,0,0,,What's the reason?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.50,1:01:13.46,中文,,0,0,0,,出发点呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.63,1:01:21.79,英文,,0,0,0,,He is afraid that my father's injustice will become known to the world. That would tarnish his reputation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.63,1:01:21.79,中文,,0,0,0,,他是怕家父的冤屈被世人知道 会影响他的清名
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.25,1:01:25.75,英文,,0,0,0,,When is Su Huan-Jen meeting with your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.25,1:01:25.75,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真是何时去见你的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:28.33,英文,,0,0,0,,On the 25th.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.54,1:01:28.33,中文,,0,0,0,,二十五日那天
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.04,1:01:30.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Does he possess the Tianwen Stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.04,1:01:30.62,中文,,0,0,0,,他得到了天问石吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.83,1:01:32.58,英文,,0,0,0,,He does.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.83,1:01:32.58,中文,,0,0,0,,得到了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.88,1:01:34.87,英文,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.88,1:01:34.87,中文,,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.58,1:01:36.87,英文,,0,0,0,,You stay here and wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.58,1:01:36.87,中文,,0,0,0,,你留在此地等我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.71,1:01:45.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Such a desolate place. Is anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.71,1:01:45.92,中文,,0,0,0,,如此荒凉的地方有人居住吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.96,1:01:51.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Please come in. Su Huan-Jen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.96,1:01:51.00,中文,,0,0,0,,请进吧 素还真
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.29,1:01:54.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.29,1:01:54.62,中文,,0,0,0,,素某有礼了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.79,1:01:58.46,英文,,0,0,0,,Please sit. Mr. Su.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.79,1:01:58.46,中文,,0,0,0,,请坐 素贤人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:00.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:00.04,中文,,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.46,1:02:12.04,英文,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were actually Jian Shang-Chin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.46,1:02:12.04,中文,,0,0,0,,原来先生就是昔日 人称之布衣上卿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.83,1:02:14.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for my ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.83,1:02:14.87,中文,,0,0,0,,请恕劣者眼拙了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.17,1:02:20.50,英文,,0,0,0,,With a face like mine, hardly anyone would recognize me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.17,1:02:20.50,中文,,0,0,0,,我变成这种模样 难怪没人认得出
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.54,1:02:24.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Sir, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.54,1:02:24.04,中文,,0,0,0,,先生为何会变成这个模样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.25,1:02:28.29,英文,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.25,1:02:28.29,中文,,0,0,0,,不提也罢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.13,1:02:36.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. I did not invite you here to talk about the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.13,1:02:36.04,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 我今天请你前来 不是要谈往事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:41.00,英文,,0,0,0,,I want to hand this Tianwen Stone over to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:41.00,中文,,0,0,0,,而是要将这颗天问石交托给你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.54,1:02:45.25,英文,,0,0,0,,This... I am too ashamed to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.54,1:02:45.25,中文,,0,0,0,,这 这劣者受之有愧啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.63,1:02:51.62,英文,,0,0,0,,No need to feel ashamed. Just accept it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.63,1:02:51.62,中文,,0,0,0,,不用客气 你尽管收下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.67,1:02:55.12,英文,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.67,1:02:55.12,中文,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.08,1:03:02.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Right, Su Huan-Jen. There's one thing I want you to promise me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.08,1:03:02.67,中文,,0,0,0,,对了 素还真我想拜托你一件事情
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.67,1:03:04.42,英文,,0,0,0,,Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.67,1:03:04.42,中文,,0,0,0,,请说
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.96,1:03:08.33,英文,,0,0,0,,You must not tell anyone
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.96,1:03:08.33,中文,,0,0,0,,今天你见到我之事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.42,1:03:11.75,英文,,0,0,0,,about our meeting here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.42,1:03:11.75,中文,,0,0,0,,请勿向任何人提起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.67,1:03:15.75,英文,,0,0,0,,And you must not bring anyone to come see me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.67,1:03:15.75,中文,,0,0,0,,也不可带任何人来此地见我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.38,1:03:20.00,英文,,0,0,0,,I will keep my mouth sealed like a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.38,1:03:20.00,中文,,0,0,0,,素某必定守口如瓶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.17,1:03:23.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Then my mind will be at ease.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.17,1:03:23.83,中文,,0,0,0,,那我就放心了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.96,1:03:28.21,英文,,0,0,0,,It's getting late. I will take my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.96,1:03:28.21,中文,,0,0,0,,打扰多时素某告辞了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.75,1:03:31.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.75,1:03:31.21,中文,,0,0,0,,不送了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.96,1:03:48.46,英文,,0,0,0,,It's nice seeing you, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.96,1:03:48.46,中文,,0,0,0,,劣者见过前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.29,1:03:50.12,英文,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.29,1:03:50.12,中文,,0,0,0,,不用多礼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.63,1:03:55.46,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. I've come here only to ask you a few questions. Then I will leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.63,1:03:55.46,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 我只是来问你几个问题 问完就离开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.38,1:04:00.21,英文,,0,0,0,,It's rare for you to be here, Senior. Why not stay here a bit longer
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.38,1:04:00.21,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈难得光临 何不留在此地
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.63,1:04:02.71,英文,,0,0,0,,so I can extend my proper hospitality?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.63,1:04:02.71,中文,,0,0,0,,让劣者尽地主之谊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.83,1:04:05.79,英文,,0,0,0,,Is the Tianwen Stone in your possession?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.83,1:04:05.79,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石是不是在你的身上
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.54,1:04:08.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes. But, this...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.54,1:04:08.29,中文,,0,0,0,,是 但这是...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.46,1:04:12.29,英文,,0,0,0,,On the 25th of this month, did you meet with Mr. Gu-Pi?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.46,1:04:12.29,中文,,0,0,0,,你有在本月二十五会见一名叫骨皮先生的人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.25,1:04:16.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Yes. Mr. Gu-Pi invited me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.25,1:04:16.58,中文,,0,0,0,,有 骨皮先生发帖邀请
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.92,1:04:18.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Can you take me to see him?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.92,1:04:18.29,中文,,0,0,0,,你能不能带我去见他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.42,1:04:20.00,英文,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.42,1:04:20.00,中文,,0,0,0,,这...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.25,1:04:25.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I made a promise. Forgive me that I cannot say more.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.25,1:04:25.67,中文,,0,0,0,,为了遵守诺言 恕劣者不能明言
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.25,1:04:30.67,英文,,0,0,0,,What a promise you've made.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.25,1:04:30.67,中文,,0,0,0,,好一个遵守诺言
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.38,1:04:32.83,英文,,0,0,0,,It's all clear to me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.38,1:04:32.83,中文,,0,0,0,,一切我都明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.38,1:04:37.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Both time and place are written on this life-and-death pact.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.38,1:04:37.67,中文,,0,0,0,,时间 地点 都在生死状之上
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.04,1:04:38.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.04,1:04:38.67,中文,,0,0,0,,告辞
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.63,1:04:41.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior! Senior!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.63,1:04:41.33,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈 前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.04,1:04:43.33,英文,,0,0,0,,No need, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.04,1:04:43.33,中文,,0,0,0,,二弟 不必叫了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.96,1:04:46.21,英文,,0,0,0,,That was a trap set by Mr. Gu-Pi.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.96,1:04:46.21,中文,,0,0,0,,我中了骨皮先生之计
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.21,1:04:48.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Who is Mr. Gu-Pi?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.21,1:04:48.58,中文,,0,0,0,,骨皮先生是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.33,1:04:50.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Lady Jian's father.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.33,1:04:50.75,中文,,0,0,0,,剑姑娘的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.00,1:04:52.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Why would he do that to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.00,1:04:52.29,中文,,0,0,0,,他为何会算计你
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.71,1:04:54.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Was there hatred between you two?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.71,1:04:54.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你们之间有仇吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.04,1:04:58.58,英文,,0,0,0,,If there was hatred, then I know nothing about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.04,1:04:58.58,中文,,0,0,0,,仇恨从何而来 素某一无所知
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.42,1:05:00.83,英文,,0,0,0,,However, based on my judgment,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.42,1:05:00.83,中文,,0,0,0,,不过依我之判断
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.42,1:05:05.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Mr. Gu-Pi must have concocted this ruthless plan for some ulterior benefit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.42,1:05:05.62,中文,,0,0,0,,骨皮先生一定是为某种利益而出此毒策
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.96,1:05:10.33,英文,,0,0,0,,If he devised this trap, then you should explain it to Senior Au-Shiau.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.96,1:05:10.33,中文,,0,0,0,,既然是他的阴谋 应该对前辈解释清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.75,1:05:15.33,英文,,0,0,0,,He wrote the life-and-death pact. There's not much I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.75,1:05:15.33,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈发下了生死状 覆水难收啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.33,1:05:17.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.33,1:05:17.00,中文,,0,0,0,,这...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.25,1:05:19.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Ching Yang. I have a battle to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.25,1:05:19.54,中文,,0,0,0,,青阳 我要去赴约
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.96,1:05:23.71,英文,,0,0,0,,You must go to Au-Shiau's house and protect Jian Ru-Bing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.96,1:05:23.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你马上前往蒿棘居 保护剑如冰
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.50,1:05:25.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Why should we protect her?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.50,1:05:25.75,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么要保护她
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.25,1:05:28.21,英文,,0,0,0,,She was the reason that Au-Shiau hates you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.25,1:05:28.21,中文,,0,0,0,,她害你与前辈反目成仇
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.71,1:05:30.75,英文,,0,0,0,,"He who tied the bell must be the one to untie it."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.71,1:05:30.75,中文,,0,0,0,,解铃还须系铃人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.33,1:05:32.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Go protect her now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.33,1:05:32.50,中文,,0,0,0,,快去保护她
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.67,1:05:46.50,英文,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Senior's meeting with Su Huan-Jen is going.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.67,1:05:46.50,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈去找素还真 不知结果如何
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.63,1:05:56.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad. May your spirit protect Senior Au-Shiau
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.63,1:05:56.17,中文,,0,0,0,,爹啊 请你在天之灵 庇佑前辈平安无事
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.83,1:06:00.00,英文,,0,0,0,,so that he will avenge your death.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.83,1:06:00.00,中文,,0,0,0,,替爹你报仇雪恨
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.00,1:06:02.54,英文,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.00,1:06:02.54,中文,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.67,1:06:07.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Hand over the Tianwen Stone!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.67,1:06:07.37,中文,,0,0,0,,将天问石交出
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.88,1:06:11.21,英文,,0,0,0,,I don't have the stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.88,1:06:11.21,中文,,0,0,0,,我的身上并没有天问石
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.96,1:06:20.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Where is the stone? Talk!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.96,1:06:20.33,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石呢 快说
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.17,1:06:26.58,英文,,0,0,0,,The stone... was taken by Su Huan-Jen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.17,1:06:26.58,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石 早已被素还真夺走了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.71,1:06:29.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.71,1:06:29.29,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.21,1:06:38.25,英文,,0,0,0,,The Su Huan-Jen you saw was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.21,1:06:38.25,中文,,0,0,0,,你所见的素还真就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.33,1:06:43.21,英文,,0,0,0,,That stone was fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.33,1:06:43.21,中文,,0,0,0,,那天那颗天问石是假的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.33,1:06:46.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Where did you hide the real one?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.33,1:06:46.00,中文,,0,0,0,,真的你藏在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.54,1:06:51.54,英文,,0,0,0,,So, it was you that killed my dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.54,1:06:51.54,中文,,0,0,0,,原来 我的爹亲是你所杀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.25,1:06:53.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen was innocent?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.25,1:06:53.83,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.04,1:06:59.25,英文,,0,0,0,,That's right. Where is the Tianwen Stone? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.04,1:06:59.25,中文,,0,0,0,,没错 天问石在哪里 快说
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.08,1:07:04.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Or I'll gouge your eyes out! Are you going to talk or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.08,1:07:04.92,中文,,0,0,0,,挖出你的眼睛 看你说不说
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.25,1:07:13.12,英文,,0,0,0,,Lady Jian. Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.25,1:07:13.12,中文,,0,0,0,,剑姑娘 快过来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.25,1:07:44.71,英文,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.25,1:07:44.71,中文,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.88,1:08:06.87,英文,,0,0,0,,One foot in troubled currents, one resting in stillness.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.88,1:08:06.87,中文,,0,0,0,,半涉浊流半席清
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.92,1:08:11.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Reclining by the qin, I hum the song of Guangling.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.92,1:08:11.08,中文,,0,0,0,,倚筝闲吟广陵文
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.17,1:08:15.12,英文,,0,0,0,,A chill sword hears the quiet vow of a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.17,1:08:15.12,中文,,0,0,0,,寒剑默听君子意
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.42,1:08:18.87,英文,,0,0,0,,I look upon the world and laugh at its folly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.42,1:08:18.87,中文,,0,0,0,,傲视人间笑红尘
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.75,1:08:26.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.75,1:08:26.37,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.46,1:08:29.54,英文,,0,0,0,,The pure and the corrupt are rarely easily told apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.46,1:08:29.54,中文,,0,0,0,,世俗清浊难分辨
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.08,1:08:35.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Right or wrong, we'll let the swords in our hands be the judge.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.08,1:08:35.75,中文,,0,0,0,,是非功过 就以手上三尺秋水 做了断吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.04,1:08:38.75,英文,,0,0,0,,No choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.04,1:08:38.75,中文,,0,0,0,,罢了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.75,1:08:54.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. You are a sword master.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.75,1:08:54.33,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 你是用剑的高手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.42,1:09:07.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.42,1:09:07.33,中文,,0,0,0,,留神了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.83,1:11:15.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. Your right arm is hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.83,1:11:15.92,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 你已伤了右臂
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.04,1:11:18.75,英文,,0,0,0,,I still have my left arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.04,1:11:18.75,中文,,0,0,0,,素某尚有左臂
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.17,1:11:21.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.17,1:11:21.00,中文,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.67,1:11:42.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Lady Jian. A few miles ahead is where the duel is taking place.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.67,1:11:42.62,中文,,0,0,0,,剑姑娘 再前进数里 就是决斗地点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:44.67,英文,,0,0,0,,You should go and stop them now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:44.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你快去阻止决斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.54,1:12:07.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Jian Wei. Stop the duel!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.54,1:12:07.37,中文,,0,0,0,,剑卫 快阻止这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.75,1:12:10.04,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen did not kill dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.75,1:12:10.04,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真并没杀死爹亲
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.54,1:12:11.92,英文,,0,0,0,,It was all a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.54,1:12:11.92,中文,,0,0,0,,这是一场误会
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.42,1:13:17.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Jian Wei. Are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.42,1:13:17.67,中文,,0,0,0,,剑卫 你要杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.88,1:13:21.04,英文,,0,0,0,,I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.88,1:13:21.04,中文,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.92,1:13:26.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Turns out everything was part of dad's scheme.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.92,1:13:26.08,中文,,0,0,0,,原来 一切都是爹亲的阴谋
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.79,1:14:33.00,英文,,0,0,0,,It's time to decide the victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.79,1:14:33.00,中文,,0,0,0,,该是分出胜负的时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.92,1:14:44.00,英文,,0,0,0,,My life ends here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.92,1:14:44.00,中文,,0,0,0,,吾命休矣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.42,1:14:49.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Spare him under the sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.42,1:14:49.92,中文,,0,0,0,,剑下留人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.50,1:14:55.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing! Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.50,1:14:55.92,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰 你怎会来此
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.46,1:15:41.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Ching Yang. Ching Yang!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.46,1:15:41.75,中文,,0,0,0,,青阳
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.63,1:16:21.25,英文,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.63,1:16:21.25,中文,,0,0,0,,走哪里去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.00,1:16:50.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong. This was a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.00,1:16:50.33,中文,,0,0,0,,不妙 是调虎离山计
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.25,1:17:00.50,英文,,0,0,0,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.25,1:17:00.50,中文,,0,0,0,,好一对狗男女
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.88,1:17:11.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Who dares contend with me for the Tianwen Stone will die!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.88,1:17:11.08,中文,,0,0,0,,谁与我争夺天问石 谁就要死
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.46,1:17:17.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Jian Wei. Take the stone. Wait for me at the foot of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.46,1:17:17.50,中文,,0,0,0,,剑卫 你先带着天问石 到山下等我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.58,1:17:24.92,英文,,0,0,0,,Without Ru-Bing, is this really a happy ending?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.58,1:17:24.92,中文,,0,0,0,,没有如冰同行 这种结局圆满吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.33,1:17:26.79,英文,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.33,1:17:26.79,中文,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.92,1:17:29.75,英文,,0,0,0,,What did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.92,1:17:29.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你叫我什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.58,1:17:31.17,英文,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.58,1:17:31.17,中文,,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.92,1:17:35.87,英文,,0,0,0,,No! You should call me father.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.92,1:17:35.87,中文,,0,0,0,,不 你应该叫我岳父
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.88,1:17:41.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Aren't you in love with Ru-Bing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.88,1:17:41.58,中文,,0,0,0,,你不是深爱着如冰吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.46,1:17:49.67,英文,,0,0,0,,You would disregard your life just for her safety, and cast aside the loyalty between master and servant.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.46,1:17:49.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你可以为了她 不顾性命安危 罔顾主仆忠义
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.29,1:17:55.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Such true and profound love is truly moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.29,1:17:55.33,中文,,0,0,0,,这种真情至爱 令人感动呀
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.63,1:17:58.00,英文,,0,0,0,,My lord, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.63,1:17:58.00,中文,,0,0,0,,主人 我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.83,1:18:04.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Return the stone. I can let bygones be bygones.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.83,1:18:04.00,中文,,0,0,0,,交还天问石 我可以既往不咎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.92,1:18:08.96,英文,,0,0,0,,I might even... let you marry Ru-Bing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.92,1:18:08.96,中文,,0,0,0,,甚至还可以将如冰许配给你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.33,1:18:11.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Pretty generous of me, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.33,1:18:11.58,中文,,0,0,0,,有够宽宏大量吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.29,1:18:16.96,英文,,0,0,0,,This is how I've always treated those I value the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.29,1:18:16.96,中文,,0,0,0,,对自己的爱将 我一向如此
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.25,1:18:20.96,英文,,0,0,0,,The Tianwen Stone is now in Su Huan-Jen's hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.25,1:18:20.96,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石已经送给素还真了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.25,1:18:34.96,英文,,0,0,0,,To give the thing I treasure the most
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.25,1:18:34.96,中文,,0,0,0,,将我最珍爱的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.75,1:18:38.37,英文,,0,0,0,,to the person I hate the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.75,1:18:38.37,中文,,0,0,0,,送给我最痛恨的仇人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.08,1:18:42.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Heavens! How ironic is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.08,1:18:42.87,中文,,0,0,0,,天呀 这是何等的讽刺
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.63,1:18:46.67,英文,,0,0,0,,This is the biggest humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.63,1:18:46.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这是极大的恥辱
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.75,1:18:51.96,英文,,0,0,0,,You have the stone on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.75,1:18:51.96,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石在你的身上
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.04,1:19:05.71,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.04,1:19:05.71,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.92,1:19:10.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Speak. What really happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.92,1:19:10.33,中文,,0,0,0,,说吧 究竟怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.25,1:19:15.75,英文,,0,0,0,,My father wanted revenge and to get the Tianwen Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.25,1:19:15.75,中文,,0,0,0,,家父为了报仇 为了得到天问石
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.96,1:19:20.92,英文,,0,0,0,,He went to great lengths to set up this deception.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.96,1:19:20.92,中文,,0,0,0,,用尽心机 设下这个骗局
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.29,1:19:23.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.29,1:19:23.96,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.46,1:19:31.58,英文,,0,0,0,,The Su Huan-Jen that I saw fighting with my dad was the Unkind in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.46,1:19:31.58,中文,,0,0,0,,当初与家父发生争执的素还真 是非善类所化
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.38,1:19:36.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I was careless, and I nearly committed a grave mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.38,1:19:36.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我一时失察 险些铸成大错
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.00,1:19:38.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.00,1:19:38.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我不愿再听闻
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.79,1:19:40.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.79,1:19:40.75,中文,,0,0,0,,请离开吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.38,1:19:53.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing is such a kind-hearted girl. But she's been used by her father all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.38,1:19:53.08,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰如此单纯善良 却一直受其父利用
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.75,1:19:59.50,英文,,0,0,0,,How can such an innocent girl suffer more misfortunes? Where is divine justice?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.75,1:19:59.50,中文,,0,0,0,,这样纯真的少女 若再遭受不幸 天理何在
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.17,1:20:11.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.17,1:20:11.62,中文,,0,0,0,,爹
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.67,1:20:15.62,英文,,0,0,0,,Do you regard me as your dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.67,1:20:15.62,中文,,0,0,0,,我是你的父亲吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.96,1:20:18.62,英文,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.96,1:20:18.62,中文,,0,0,0,,我看不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.67,1:20:23.96,英文,,0,0,0,,What kind of daughter would try to kill her own father?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.67,1:20:23.96,中文,,0,0,0,,天底下哪有女儿想害死父亲的道理
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.33,1:20:28.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Father, please don't keep making the same mistake. Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.33,1:20:28.58,中文,,0,0,0,,爹亲 请不要一错再错 听我解释
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.00,1:20:34.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Why did you collude with Jian-Wei to steal my Tianwen Stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.00,1:20:34.50,中文,,0,0,0,,那你为什么串通剑卫 偷走我的天问石
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.25,1:20:38.37,英文,,0,0,0,,You nearly reduced my years of hard work to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.25,1:20:38.37,中文,,0,0,0,,险些让我多年的心血化为乌有
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.08,1:20:41.67,英文,,0,0,0,,You're deliberately trying to make me suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.08,1:20:41.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你们是存心让我痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.29,1:20:44.37,英文,,0,0,0,,You all wanted to torment me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.29,1:20:44.37,中文,,0,0,0,,你们存心要忤逆我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.79,1:20:50.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad. You shouldn't think that everyone in the world owes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.79,1:20:50.17,中文,,0,0,0,,爹亲 你不应该认为世人都对不起你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.13,1:20:52.83,英文,,0,0,0,,It's the way you do things...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.13,1:20:52.83,中文,,0,0,0,,实在是你的手段
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.33,1:20:54.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.33,1:20:54.00,中文,,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.21,1:21:00.08,英文,,0,0,0,,You foolish, ungrateful brat! Still dare to argue?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.21,1:21:00.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你这个不识大体的娃儿 还敢狡辩
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.08,1:21:03.33,英文,,0,0,0,,People owe me everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.08,1:21:03.33,中文,,0,0,0,,世人就是对不起我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.21,1:21:07.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten how your mother died?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.21,1:21:07.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你忘记了你的母亲是怎样死的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.96,1:21:12.00,英文,,0,0,0,,And how your brother died while he tried to protect you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.96,1:21:12.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你的兄长为了保护你 又是怎样死的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.88,1:21:14.62,英文,,0,0,0,,"A grown daughter can't be kept."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.88,1:21:14.62,中文,,0,0,0,,女大不中留
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.08,1:21:17.42,英文,,0,0,0,,You're already siding with the outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.08,1:21:17.42,中文,,0,0,0,,你已经一心向着外人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.17,1:21:22.96,英文,,0,0,0,,You think that revenge is only a matter of mine. You have nothing to do with it. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.17,1:21:22.96,中文,,0,0,0,,认为报仇是我一个人的事 与你无关 对不对
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.63,1:21:25.87,英文,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.63,1:21:25.87,中文,,0,0,0,,不是 我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.63,1:21:31.17,英文,,0,0,0,,If not, then why did you steal the Tianwen Stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.63,1:21:31.17,中文,,0,0,0,,如果不是 你为何要偷走天问石
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.00,1:21:35.08,英文,,0,0,0,,You can now go and tell Au-Shiau Hung-Chen
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.00,1:21:35.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你现在就可以去传达傲笑红尘
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.00,1:21:40.58,英文,,0,0,0,,about how vicious and heartless I am, and how I have no compassion!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.00,1:21:40.58,中文,,0,0,0,,说我是一名心狠手辣的人 毫无人性
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.21,1:21:42.71,英文,,0,0,0,,Tell him to come and kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.21,1:21:42.71,中文,,0,0,0,,叫他来杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.21,1:21:48.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad! What do I need to do for you to believe me??
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.21,1:21:48.33,中文,,0,0,0,,爹 你到底要怎样才肯相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.46,1:21:54.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Can't you see and feel my love and filiality for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.46,1:21:54.50,中文,,0,0,0,,女儿对你的一片孝心 你还无法体会吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.83,1:22:10.21,英文,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I am both cunning and wise. I've gotten the stone back.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.83,1:22:10.21,中文,,0,0,0,,幸亏我多谋足智 天问石失而复得
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.33,1:22:13.46,英文,,0,0,0,,So don't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.33,1:22:13.46,中文,,0,0,0,,不必惊讶
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.38,1:22:18.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing. It's not difficult to prove your filial piety
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.38,1:22:18.83,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰 其实要表现你对我的至孝
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.33,1:22:23.33,英文,,0,0,0,,and your devotion to me as a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.33,1:22:23.33,中文,,0,0,0,,要尽为人子女的孝道并不困难
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.79,1:22:27.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Come. Make a wish to the stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.79,1:22:27.00,中文,,0,0,0,,来 向天问石许愿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.88,1:22:30.58,英文,,0,0,0,,Wish for the return of my former glory
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.88,1:22:30.58,中文,,0,0,0,,让我恢复往日的风采
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.38,1:22:34.33,英文,,0,0,0,,and grant me supreme, invincible Kung Fu!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.38,1:22:34.33,中文,,0,0,0,,让我拥有天下无敌的武功
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.67,1:22:42.83,英文,,0,0,0,,Dad! You said you wanted the stone to eliminate the Unkinds.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.67,1:22:42.83,中文,,0,0,0,,爹 当初取得天问石的目的 是为了消灭非善类
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.88,1:22:45.29,英文,,0,0,0,,But now, you...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.88,1:22:45.29,中文,,0,0,0,,可是现在你...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.17,1:22:47.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Silly girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.17,1:22:47.37,中文,,0,0,0,,傻孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.33,1:22:51.12,英文,,0,0,0,,Once your father possesses invincible power,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.33,1:22:51.12,中文,,0,0,0,,为父有了天下无敌的武功
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.75,1:22:54.50,英文,,0,0,0,,destroying the Unkinds will be all too easy!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.75,1:22:54.50,中文,,0,0,0,,还怕消灭不了非善类吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.75,1:22:55.50,英文,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.75,1:22:55.50,中文,,0,0,0,,这...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.29,1:22:58.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Jian Shang-Chin. You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.29,1:22:58.75,中文,,0,0,0,,剑上卿 你变了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.13,1:23:14.58,英文,,0,0,0,,That's right. I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.13,1:23:14.58,中文,,0,0,0,,没错 我变了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.42,1:23:17.25,英文,,0,0,0,,See how I look
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.42,1:23:17.25,中文,,0,0,0,,你看我如今的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.75,1:23:20.04,英文,,0,0,0,,and the place where I live now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.75,1:23:20.04,中文,,0,0,0,,你看我安身的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.75,1:23:24.75,英文,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer the Jian Shang-Chin I once was.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.75,1:23:24.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我已经不是以前的布衣上卿了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.17,1:23:27.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Your appearance and your abode are trivial.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.17,1:23:27.00,中文,,0,0,0,,外貌 华厦不算什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.71,1:23:29.00,英文,,0,0,0,,It's your heart that's changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.71,1:23:29.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你变的是你的心
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.71,1:23:33.00,英文,,0,0,0,,You knew that if you made that wish, Ru-Bing would die for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.71,1:23:33.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你明知许下愿望 如冰必死无疑
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.75,1:23:37.62,英文,,0,0,0,,But you would rather sacrifice your own daughter for your own interests.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.75,1:23:37.62,中文,,0,0,0,,你竟然为了自己的利益 连女儿也牺牲
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.21,1:23:43.17,英文,,0,0,0,,When a father asks a child to die, then they must die out of filiality.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.21,1:23:43.17,中文,,0,0,0,,父要子死 子不死不孝
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.21,1:23:48.54,英文,,0,0,0,,I endured countless hardships to raise her to adulthood.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.21,1:23:48.54,中文,,0,0,0,,我含辛茹苦 养了她二三十年
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.54,1:23:53.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Now I want her to repay me. What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.54,1:23:53.75,中文,,0,0,0,,现在要她回报 有何不可
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.63,1:23:57.75,英文,,0,0,0,,I cannot stand idly by and allow you to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.63,1:23:57.75,中文,,0,0,0,,素某不能坐视你杀害如冰姑娘
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.92,1:24:04.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen. I didn't expect you'd be here so soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.92,1:24:04.00,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 你来得好快
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.67,1:24:07.08,英文,,0,0,0,,Wu-Yan. Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.67,1:24:07.08,中文,,0,0,0,,无言 杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.54,1:24:20.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Make the wish! Make the wish and I won't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.54,1:24:20.96,中文,,0,0,0,,许愿 许愿我就不杀他们两个
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.33,1:24:22.92,英文,,0,0,0,,He's not capable of killing us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.33,1:24:22.92,中文,,0,0,0,,凭他还杀不了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.00,1:24:26.08,英文,,0,0,0,,"When you can't kill, you get killed."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.00,1:24:26.08,中文,,0,0,0,,不能杀人就是被杀
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.67,1:24:30.75,英文,,0,0,0,,If I die, will you be heartbroken, daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.67,1:24:30.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我死了 女儿你不会心疼吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.54,1:24:35.00,英文,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.54,1:24:35.00,中文,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.50,1:24:38.04,英文,,0,0,0,,I'll make the wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.50,1:24:38.04,中文,,0,0,0,,我替你许愿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.08,1:24:40.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.08,1:24:40.17,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰不可呀
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.17,1:24:50.50,英文,,0,0,0,,Quick! Make your wish! Grant me the greatest martial arts in the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.17,1:24:50.50,中文,,0,0,0,,快 你赶快许愿 让我拥有天下第一的武功
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.92,1:24:51.71,英文,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.92,1:24:51.71,中文,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.00,1:24:58.46,英文,,0,0,0,,But what if you break your promise and kill Senior Au-Shiau and Su Huan-Jen?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.00,1:24:58.46,中文,,0,0,0,,但是如果你没放过傲笑红尘 以及素还真他们呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.38,1:25:00.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.38,1:25:00.17,中文,,0,0,0,,这...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.13,1:25:09.04,英文,,0,0,0,,If I betray my words, then I'd die under the tears of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.13,1:25:09.04,中文,,0,0,0,,如果我背信 我甘愿死在死人的眼泪之下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.00,1:25:16.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Father. Remember what you said.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.00,1:25:16.75,中文,,0,0,0,,父亲 您要谨记您说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.08,1:25:23.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Tianwen Stone...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.08,1:25:23.33,中文,,0,0,0,,天问石
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.38,1:25:27.67,英文,,0,0,0,,Please let my father Jian Shang-Chin
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.38,1:25:27.67,中文,,0,0,0,,请你让我的父亲剑上卿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.17,1:25:30.29,英文,,0,0,0,,retain his former glory
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.17,1:25:30.29,中文,,0,0,0,,恢复以往的风采
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.08,1:25:33.54,英文,,0,0,0,,and grant him invincible martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.08,1:25:33.54,中文,,0,0,0,,让他的武功无人能敌
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.54,1:25:38.50,英文,,0,0,0,,If Jian Shang-Chin breaks his vow,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.54,1:25:38.50,中文,,0,0,0,,如果剑上卿违背誓言
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.00,1:25:42.29,英文,,0,0,0,,then he will die under the tears of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.00,1:25:42.29,中文,,0,0,0,,他将会死在死人的眼泪之下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.71,1:25:50.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.71,1:25:50.37,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.21,1:25:57.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.21,1:25:57.75,中文,,0,0,0,,不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.21,1:26:29.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.21,1:26:29.17,中文,,0,0,0,,快 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.17,1:26:30.54,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen, you're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.17,1:26:30.54,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真你的剑不够快
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.96,1:26:45.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Swordplay is not about speed!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.96,1:26:45.75,中文,,0,0,0,,剑不是用来比快的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.88,1:27:47.25,英文,,0,0,0,,I am rejuvenated!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.88,1:27:47.25,中文,,0,0,0,,我复元了 我复元了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.08,1:27:51.00,英文,,0,0,0,,I actually possess the greatest martial arts in the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.08,1:27:51.00,中文,,0,0,0,,我真的有了天下第一的武功
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.71,1:27:55.37,英文,,0,0,0,,So what if you possess it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.71,1:27:55.37,中文,,0,0,0,,哼 拥有天下第一的武功又如何
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.13,1:27:59.00,英文,,0,0,0,,"Too many evil deeds will surely bring heavenly punishment."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.13,1:27:59.00,中文,,0,0,0,,多行不义 必受天谴
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.42,1:28:08.04,英文,,0,0,0,,What a shame that you, Su Huan-Jen, won't live to see the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.42,1:28:08.04,中文,,0,0,0,,很可惜 你素还真没眼福看到这种结局
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.00,1:28:32.83,英文,,0,0,0,,You're so silly. Why did you make the wish?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.00,1:28:32.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你太傻了 为何要许下如此心愿
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.42,1:28:33.83,英文,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.42,1:28:33.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.67,1:28:42.75,英文,,0,0,0,,All these years, my father endured a life worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.67,1:28:42.75,中文,,0,0,0,,这么多年来 我的父亲真的是生不如死
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.33,1:28:48.17,英文,,0,0,0,,But why? Why must you suffer like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.33,1:28:48.17,中文,,0,0,0,,你这是何苦 这是何苦啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.17,1:28:55.17,英文,,0,0,0,,To die in your arms is all I could ever wish for.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.17,1:28:55.17,中文,,0,0,0,,能死在你的怀中 我已无所求
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.08,1:29:00.37,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing. You...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.08,1:29:00.37,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰 你...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.38,1:29:07.67,英文,,0,0,0,,I...just want to see you turn water into ice once more.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.38,1:29:07.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我 想再看一次 凝水成冰的功夫
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.67,1:29:15.87,英文,,0,0,0,,Don't let my tears be shed in vain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.67,1:29:15.87,中文,,0,0,0,,不要让我的眼泪 白流
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.75,1:29:26.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Ru-Bing. Ru-Bing!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.75,1:29:26.29,中文,,0,0,0,,如冰
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.25,1:30:10.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Jian Shang-Chin. You wouldn't even cherish your own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.25,1:30:10.29,中文,,0,0,0,,剑上卿 你连亲生的骨肉都不会爱惜
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.92,1:30:14.75,英文,,0,0,0,,If you're allowed to live, then it will be a great calamity for the martial world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.92,1:30:14.75,中文,,0,0,0,,如果容许你活在世上 将是武林浩劫也
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.79,1:30:16.71,英文,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.79,1:30:16.71,中文,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.46,1:30:18.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Au-Shiau Hung-Chen...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.46,1:30:18.75,中文,,0,0,0,,傲笑红尘
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.42,1:30:22.33,英文,,0,0,0,,I've long wanted to see how far your swordplay has progressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.42,1:30:22.33,中文,,0,0,0,,我一直想了解你的剑法到什么程度
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.46,1:31:08.87,英文,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect it to be so shallow.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.46,1:31:08.87,中文,,0,0,0,,想不到你的根基如此的浅薄
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.13,1:31:12.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Your power was built on the death of Ru-Bing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.13,1:31:12.29,中文,,0,0,0,,你的根基是建立在如冰的屍体之上
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.25,1:31:15.00,英文,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.25,1:31:15.00,中文,,0,0,0,,不值得引以为傲
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.92,1:31:21.00,英文,,0,0,0,,My power is given by God. You do not stand a winning chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.92,1:31:21.00,中文,,0,0,0,,哼 我的根基是上天所赐 你没胜算啦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.42,1:31:25.17,英文,,0,0,0,,Your power was given by Ru-Bing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.42,1:31:25.17,中文,,0,0,0,,成就你者 是如冰
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.83,1:31:28.29,英文,,0,0,0,,Your life will also be taken by Ru-Bing!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.83,1:31:28.29,中文,,0,0,0,,杀你者 也是如冰
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.67,1:32:28.33,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.67,1:32:28.33,中文,,0,0,0,,前輩
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.00,1:32:31.96,英文,,0,0,0,,Please hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.00,1:32:31.96,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈请听素某一言
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.25,1:32:34.67,英文,,0,0,0,,The Unkinds have yet to be eradicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.25,1:32:34.67,中文,,0,0,0,,非善类尚未除尽
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.54,1:32:39.21,英文,,0,0,0,,There are troubles in Wulin. We need you, Senior, to take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.54,1:32:39.21,中文,,0,0,0,,武林忧患 需要前辈主持大局
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.33,1:32:43.29,英文,,0,0,0,,In this world, who are truly the kind ones?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.33,1:32:43.29,中文,,0,0,0,,这个世上 谁又是善类
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.25,1:32:51.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Su Huan-Jen, I sincerely hope that I was wrong about you all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.25,1:32:51.75,中文,,0,0,0,,素还真 但愿过去 我对你的看法是错误的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.79,1:32:53.75,英文,,0,0,0,,Senior!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.79,1:32:53.75,中文,,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.27,1:36:09.85,中文,,0,1220,0,,♪稀微的风中♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.06,1:36:15.94,中文,,0,1220,0,,♪珠泪飘落寒冷异乡♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.60,1:36:24.60,中文,,0,1220,0,,♪举头望 山河的面容♪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.98,1:36:31.56,中文,,0,1220,0,,♪恩恩怨怨苍天无量♪
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.38,1:38:36.96,中文,,0,0,0,,♪稀微的风中♪
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.38,1:38:43.25,中文,,0,0,0,,♪发丝交缠苍白的霜♪
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.88,1:38:51.87,中文,,0,0,0,,♪怎能忘 世恨的凌辱♪
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.29,1:38:58.83,中文,,0,0,0,,♪了然一生又有何用♪
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.21,1:39:06.96,中文,,0,0,0,,♪待天明露水已去♪
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.17,1:39:12.37,中文,,0,0,0,,♪寻我行踪♪
